      "title": "Marketing Manager",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>I feel about the opportunity to take on new challenges and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"support\">support</option><option value=\"comfortable\">comfortable</option><option value=\"position\">position</option><option value=\"ahead\">ahead</option><option value=\"opportunity\">opportunity</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option><option value=\"confident\">confident</option><option value=\"forward\">forward</option><option value=\"know\">know</option></select> to the team. While I was working at my previous job, I gained valuable experience that I believe will be beneficial in this role. I am eager to take a <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"support\">support</option><option value=\"comfortable\">comfortable</option><option value=\"position\">position</option><option value=\"ahead\">ahead</option><option value=\"opportunity\">opportunity</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option><option value=\"confident\">confident</option><option value=\"forward\">forward</option><option value=\"know\">know</option></select> at your esteemed company and I am <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"support\">support</option><option value=\"comfortable\">comfortable</option><option value=\"position\">position</option><option value=\"ahead\">ahead</option><option value=\"opportunity\">opportunity</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option><option value=\"confident\">confident</option><option value=\"forward\">forward</option><option value=\"know\">know</option></select> that my skills and experience make me a strong candidate. Please let me <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"support\">support</option><option value=\"comfortable\">comfortable</option><option value=\"position\">position</option><option value=\"ahead\">ahead</option><option value=\"opportunity\">opportunity</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option><option value=\"confident\">confident</option><option value=\"forward\">forward</option><option value=\"know\">know</option></select> if there are any additional steps I need to take or information I need to provide. I am looking <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"support\">support</option><option value=\"comfortable\">comfortable</option><option value=\"position\">position</option><option value=\"ahead\">ahead</option><option value=\"opportunity\">opportunity</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option><option value=\"confident\">confident</option><option value=\"forward\">forward</option><option value=\"know\">know</option></select> to your response.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、contribute</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `contribute to` 构成固定搭配,意思是“为......做贡献”。该搭配能准确连接空格前后的词,并使本句意思完整。因此填 `contribute`。</p>\n<p>2、position</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `take a position` 构成固定搭配,意思是“获得/担任一个职位”。该搭配能准确连接空格前后的词,并使本句意思完整。因此填 `position`。</p>\n<p>3、confident</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 这是求职信语境,前面表达自己愿意接受新挑战并加入公司,后面说明自己的技能和经验使自己成为强有力的候选人。confident that 表示“确信......”,符合该句语境,因此填 `confident`。</p>\n<p>4、know</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `let me know` 构成固定搭配,意思是“请告诉我/请告知我”。该搭配能准确连接空格前后的词,并使本句意思完整。因此填 `know`。</p>\n<p>5、forward</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `look forward to` 构成固定搭配,意思是“期待......”。该搭配能准确连接空格前后的词,并使本句意思完整。因此填 `forward`。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>I feel about the opportunity to take on new challenges and contribute to the team.</p>\n<p>我对有机会迎接新的挑战并为团队做出贡献感到期待。</p>\n<p>While I was working at my previous job, I gained valuable experience that I believe will be beneficial in this role.</p>\n<p>在上一份工作中，我积累了宝贵的经验，我相信这些经验会对这个职位有所帮助。</p>\n<p>I am eager to take a position at your esteemed company and I am confident that my skills and experience make me a strong candidate.</p>\n<p>我渴望在贵公司任职，并且确信我的技能和经验使我成为一名有竞争力的候选人。</p>\n<p>Please let me know if there are any additional steps I need to take or information I need to provide.</p>\n<p>如果我还需要完成其他步骤或提供更多信息，请告诉我。</p>\n<p>I am looking forward to your response.</p>\n<p>我期待您的回复。</p>",
