      "title": "Physical Activity",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Participating regularly in physical activity has been shown to benefit an individual's health and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"recruits\">recruits</option><option value=\"recommends\">recommends</option><option value=\"exploit\">exploit</option><option value=\"chronic\">chronic</option><option value=\"preferably\">preferably</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"affordably\">affordably</option><option value=\"physical\">physical</option><option value=\"obtain\">obtain</option><option value=\"wellbeing\">wellbeing</option></select> . Regular <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"recruits\">recruits</option><option value=\"recommends\">recommends</option><option value=\"exploit\">exploit</option><option value=\"chronic\">chronic</option><option value=\"preferably\">preferably</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"affordably\">affordably</option><option value=\"physical\">physical</option><option value=\"obtain\">obtain</option><option value=\"wellbeing\">wellbeing</option></select> activity is important in reducing the risk of <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"recruits\">recruits</option><option value=\"recommends\">recommends</option><option value=\"exploit\">exploit</option><option value=\"chronic\">chronic</option><option value=\"preferably\">preferably</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"affordably\">affordably</option><option value=\"physical\">physical</option><option value=\"obtain\">obtain</option><option value=\"wellbeing\">wellbeing</option></select> diseases, such as heart disease and stroke, obesity, diabetes and some forms of cancer. The National Physical Activity Guidelines for Adults <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"recruits\">recruits</option><option value=\"recommends\">recommends</option><option value=\"exploit\">exploit</option><option value=\"chronic\">chronic</option><option value=\"preferably\">preferably</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"affordably\">affordably</option><option value=\"physical\">physical</option><option value=\"obtain\">obtain</option><option value=\"wellbeing\">wellbeing</option></select> at least 30 minutes of moderate-intensity physical activity, <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"recruits\">recruits</option><option value=\"recommends\">recommends</option><option value=\"exploit\">exploit</option><option value=\"chronic\">chronic</option><option value=\"preferably\">preferably</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"affordably\">affordably</option><option value=\"physical\">physical</option><option value=\"obtain\">obtain</option><option value=\"wellbeing\">wellbeing</option></select> every day of the week, to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"6\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"recruits\">recruits</option><option value=\"recommends\">recommends</option><option value=\"exploit\">exploit</option><option value=\"chronic\">chronic</option><option value=\"preferably\">preferably</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"affordably\">affordably</option><option value=\"physical\">physical</option><option value=\"obtain\">obtain</option><option value=\"wellbeing\">wellbeing</option></select> health benefits.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、wellbeing</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 这里看并列关系:`... and/or wellbeing` 在词性和语义上保持一致。原句相关表达是“in physical activity has been shown to benefit an individual&#x27;s health and wellbeing . Regular physical activity is important in reducing the risk of chronic”,填 `wellbeing` 后,并列结构完整。</p>\n<p>2、physical</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说定期体育活动对于降低慢性疾病的⻛险非常重要,如心脏病和中⻛,肥胖,糖尿病和一些形式的癌症。physical activity 表示“体育活动”,符合该句语境,因此填 `physical`。</p>\n<p>3、chronic</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说定期体育活动对于降低慢性疾病的⻛险非常重要,如心脏病和中⻛,肥胖,糖尿病和一些形式的癌症。chronic diseases 表示“慢性疾病”,符合该句语境,因此填 `chronic`。</p>\n<p>4、recommends</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说《成人国家体育活动指南》建议,为了获得健康效益,每周至少进行30分钟中等强度的体育活动,最好每天进行。recommends at least 30 minutes 表示“建议至少 30 分钟”,符合该句语境,因此填 `recommends`。</p>\n<p>5、preferably</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说《成人国家体育活动指南》建议,为了获得健康效益,每周至少进行30分钟中等强度的体育活动,最好每天进行。preferably every day 表示“最好每天”,符合该句语境,因此填 `preferably`。</p>\n<p>6、obtain</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说《成人国家体育活动指南》建议,为了获得健康效益,每周至少进行30分钟中等强度的体育活动,最好每天进行。obtain health benefits 表示“获得健康效益”,符合该句语境,因此填 `obtain`。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Participating regularly in physical activity has been shown to benefit an individual's health and wellbeing.</p>\n<p>定期参加体育活动已被证明对个人健康和福祉有益。</p>\n<p>Regular physical activity is important in reducing the risk of chronic diseases, such as heart disease and stroke, obesity, diabetes and some forms of cancer.</p>\n<p>定期体育活动对于降低慢性疾病的⻛险非常重要,如心脏病和中⻛,肥胖,糖尿病和一些形式的癌症。</p>\n<p>The National Physical Activity Guidelines for Adults recommends at least 30 minutes of moderate-intensity physical activity, preferably every day of the week, to obtain health benefits.</p>\n<p>《成人国家体育活动指南》建议,为了获得健康效益,每周至少进行30分钟中等强度的体育活动,最好每天进行。</p>",
