      "id": "fib-r-5may-very-high-1164",
      "question_id": 1164,
      "title": "License Change",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>New B.C. residents will only be required to provide their driver licence history ― proof of insurance is no longer required. However, their premiums will be adjusted for the first three years <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"in\">in</option><option value=\"shown\">shown</option><option value=\"due to\">due to</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"of\">of</option><option value=\"credit\">credit</option><option value=\"deduct\">deduct</option><option value=\"showing\">showing</option></select> driving in B.C. <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"in\">in</option><option value=\"shown\">shown</option><option value=\"due to\">due to</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"of\">of</option><option value=\"credit\">credit</option><option value=\"deduct\">deduct</option><option value=\"showing\">showing</option></select> the increased risks associated with driving in a new area. Each year you remain crash-free, your discount increases. ICBC will <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"in\">in</option><option value=\"shown\">shown</option><option value=\"due to\">due to</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"of\">of</option><option value=\"credit\">credit</option><option value=\"deduct\">deduct</option><option value=\"showing\">showing</option></select> you with up to 15 years of driving experience (up from eight years) upon receipt of a driver's abstract <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"in\">in</option><option value=\"shown\">shown</option><option value=\"due to\">due to</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"of\">of</option><option value=\"credit\">credit</option><option value=\"deduct\">deduct</option><option value=\"showing\">showing</option></select> the original date that you received your license. When obtaining your B.C. license, you can provide your original driver's abstract in person at a driver licensing office.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、of</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the first three years ______ driving”，表示“……年驾驶（时间）”，英语中用“years of driving”这一固定结构来表达。因此填 of。</p>\n<p>2、due to</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ the increased risks”，此处需要表示“由于、因为”的短语，连接前文保费调整与后文风险增加之间的因果关系。due to 是固定搭配，意为“由于”，符合句意。因此填 due to。（because 也可表示原因，但语法上 because 通常引导从句，后面接完整句子，此处后面是名词短语，故 due to 更合适）</p>\n<p>3、credit</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“ICBC will ______ you with up to 15 years of driving experience”，credit sb. with sth. 是固定搭配，意为“将……记入某人名下/认可某人有……”。表示 ICBC 会根据驾驶记录认可驾驶者的驾驶经验年限。因此填 credit。</p>\n<p>4、showing</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“a driver&#x27;s abstract ______ the original date”，a driver&#x27;s abstract（驾驶记录摘要）与 show（显示）之间为主动关系，应用现在分词作后置定语，相当于“that shows the original date”。因此填 showing。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>New B.C. residents will only be required to provide their driver licence history - proof of insurance is no longer required.</p>\n<p>不列颠哥伦比亚省的新居民只需要提供驾驶执照历史，不再需要提供保险证明。</p>\n<p>However, their premiums will be adjusted for the first three years of driving in B.C. due to the increased risks associated with driving in a new area.</p>\n<p>然而，由于在新地区驾驶会带来更高风险，他们在不列颠哥伦比亚省驾驶的前三年，保险费会进行调整。</p>\n<p>Each year you remain crash-free, your discount increases.</p>\n<p>每一年只要没有发生事故，你的折扣就会增加。</p>\n<p>ICBC will credit you with up to 15 years of driving experience upon receipt of a driver's abstract showing the original date that you received your license.</p>\n<p>ICBC 在收到显示你最初获得驾照日期的驾驶记录摘要后，最多会认可你 15 年的驾驶经验。</p>\n<p>When obtaining your B.C. license, you can provide your original driver's abstract in person at a driver licensing office.</p>\n<p>办理不列颠哥伦比亚省驾照时，你可以亲自到驾驶执照办公室提交原始驾驶记录摘要。</p>",
