      "passage_html": "<p>After years in the wilderness, the term ‘artificial intelligence’ (AI) seems <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"incarnation\">incarnation</option><option value=\"inverted\">inverted</option><option value=\"image\">image</option><option value=\"consciousness\">consciousness</option><option value=\"divided\">divided</option><option value=\"rehabilitation\">rehabilitation</option><option value=\"constructed\">constructed</option><option value=\"poised\">poised</option><option value=\"ignited\">ignited</option><option value=\"invented\">invented</option></select> to make a comeback. AI was big in the 1980s but vanished in the 1990s. It re-entered public <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"incarnation\">incarnation</option><option value=\"inverted\">inverted</option><option value=\"image\">image</option><option value=\"consciousness\">consciousness</option><option value=\"divided\">divided</option><option value=\"rehabilitation\">rehabilitation</option><option value=\"constructed\">constructed</option><option value=\"poised\">poised</option><option value=\"ignited\">ignited</option><option value=\"invented\">invented</option></select> with the release of Al, a movie about a robot boy. This has <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"incarnation\">incarnation</option><option value=\"inverted\">inverted</option><option value=\"image\">image</option><option value=\"consciousness\">consciousness</option><option value=\"divided\">divided</option><option value=\"rehabilitation\">rehabilitation</option><option value=\"constructed\">constructed</option><option value=\"poised\">poised</option><option value=\"ignited\">ignited</option><option value=\"invented\">invented</option></select> public debate about AI, but the term is also being used once more within the computer industry. Researchers, executives and marketing people are now using the expression without irony or <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"incarnation\">incarnation</option><option value=\"inverted\">inverted</option><option value=\"image\">image</option><option value=\"consciousness\">consciousness</option><option value=\"divided\">divided</option><option value=\"rehabilitation\">rehabilitation</option><option value=\"constructed\">constructed</option><option value=\"poised\">poised</option><option value=\"ignited\">ignited</option><option value=\"invented\">invented</option></select> commas. And it is not always hype. The term is being applied, with some justification, to products that depend on technology that was originally developed by AI researchers. Admittedly, the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"incarnation\">incarnation</option><option value=\"inverted\">inverted</option><option value=\"image\">image</option><option value=\"consciousness\">consciousness</option><option value=\"divided\">divided</option><option value=\"rehabilitation\">rehabilitation</option><option value=\"constructed\">constructed</option><option value=\"poised\">poised</option><option value=\"ignited\">ignited</option><option value=\"invented\">invented</option></select> of the term has a long way to go, and some firms still prefer to avoid using it. But the fact that others are starting to use it again suggests that AI has moved on from being seen as an over-ambitious and under-achieving field of research.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、poised</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“seems ______ to make a comeback”，seem poised to do sth. 是固定搭配，意为“似乎准备/即将做某事”。表示人工智能似乎即将卷土重来。因此填 poised。</p>\n<p>2、consciousness</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“re-entered public ______”，re-enter public consciousness 是常见搭配，意为“重新进入公众意识/公众视野”。表示随着电影《人工智能》的发行，AI 重新进入公众的意识中。因此填 consciousness。</p>\n<p>3、ignited</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“has ______ public debate about AI”，ignite public debate 是常见搭配，意为“引发公众辩论”。表示这部电影引发了关于 AI 的公众讨论。因此填 ignited。</p>\n<p>4、inverted</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“without irony or ______ commas”，inverted commas 是固定搭配，意为“引号”。without irony or inverted commas 表示人们使用 AI 这个术语时不再带有讽刺意味或不再加引号（即不再表示怀疑或特殊含义）。因此填 inverted。</p>\n<p>5、rehabilitation</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the ______ of the term has a long way to go”，前文提到 AI 在 1990 年代消失，现在重新被使用，但本句说还有很长的路要走，说明这个词的“复兴/恢复名誉”尚未完成。rehabilitation 意为“复兴、恢复”，符合上下文语义。因此填 rehabilitation。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>After years in the wilderness, the term ‘artificial intelligence’ (AI) seems poised to make a comeback.</p>\n<p>经过数年的无人问津,“人工智能(” AI)这一术语似乎正蓄势回归。</p>\n<p>AI was big in the 1980s but vanished in the 1990s.</p>\n<p>人工智能曾在20世纪80年代⻛靡一时,但90年代便销声匿迹。</p>\n<p>It re-entered public consciousness with the release of Al, a movie about a robot boy.</p>\n<p>随着电影《人工智能》的发布,它重新进入了公众的视野,这部电影讲述了一个机器人男孩的故事。</p>\n<p>This has ignited public debate about AI, but the term is also being used once more within the computer industry.</p>\n<p>这引发了关于人工智能的公众辩论,但这个术语在计算机行业也在被再次使用。</p>\n<p>Researchers, executives and marketing people are now using the expression without irony or inverted commas.</p>\n<p>研究人员、管理人员和营销人员现在正在使用这一术语,没有讽刺或反语。</p>\n<p>And it is not always hype.</p>\n<p>而这并不总是夸大其词。</p>\n<p>The term is being applied, with some justification, to products that depend on technology that was originally developed by AI researchers.</p>\n<p>这一术语被应用于某些产品,这些产品依赖最初由人工智能研究人员开发的技术,这在一定程度上是合理的。</p>\n<p>Admittedly, the rehabilitation of the term has a long way to go, and some firms still prefer to avoid using it.</p>\n<p>不可否认,该术语的复兴还有很长的路要走,一些公司仍然尽量避免使用它。</p>\n<p>But the fact that others are starting to use it again suggests that AI has moved on from being seen as an over-ambitious and under-achieving field of research.</p>\n<p>但其他人再次开始使用这一术语的事实表明,人工智能已经摆脱被视为野心勃 勃、成就不足的研究领域。</p>",
