      "title": "Class Participation",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Because of the instructional methods, expected class participation and the nature of the courses vary, no fixed number of absences is applicable to all <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"situations\">situations</option><option value=\"member\">member</option><option value=\"assignments\">assignments</option><option value=\"attendance\">attendance</option><option value=\"roster\">roster</option><option value=\"instructor\">instructor</option><option value=\"semester\">semester</option></select> . Each <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"situations\">situations</option><option value=\"member\">member</option><option value=\"assignments\">assignments</option><option value=\"attendance\">attendance</option><option value=\"roster\">roster</option><option value=\"instructor\">instructor</option><option value=\"semester\">semester</option></select> is responsible for making clear to the class at the beginning of the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"situations\">situations</option><option value=\"member\">member</option><option value=\"assignments\">assignments</option><option value=\"attendance\">attendance</option><option value=\"roster\">roster</option><option value=\"instructor\">instructor</option><option value=\"semester\">semester</option></select> his or her policies and procedures in regard to class <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"situations\">situations</option><option value=\"member\">member</option><option value=\"assignments\">assignments</option><option value=\"attendance\">attendance</option><option value=\"roster\">roster</option><option value=\"instructor\">instructor</option><option value=\"semester\">semester</option></select> and the reasons for them.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、situations</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“applicable to all ______”，前文提到“no fixed number of absences is applicable to all”，意思是固定的缺勤次数并不适用于所有“情况”。由于不同课程的教学方法和参与要求各不相同，因此需要根据具体情况而定。situations 意为“情况/情境”，符合上下文语义。因此填 situations。</p>\n<p>2、instructor</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“Each ______ is responsible for making clear...”，本句主语应为负责制定和说明出勤政策的人。结合后文“his or her policies and procedures”，以及课程教学的语境，instructor（教师/授课者）符合逻辑。因此填 instructor。</p>\n<p>3、semester</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“at the beginning of the ______”，at the beginning of the semester 是固定搭配，意为“在学期开始时”。教师在学期初向学生说明课程政策是常见的教学安排。因此填 semester。</p>\n<p>4、attendance</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“class ______”，class attendance 是固定搭配，意为“课堂出勤”。前文一直在讨论缺勤（absences）的问题，此处指教师需说明关于课堂出勤的政策和程序，语义一致。因此填 attendance。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Because of the instructional methods, expected class participation and the nature of the courses vary, no fixed number of absences is applicable to all situations .</p>\n<p>由于教学方法和预期的课堂参与度和课程性质各不相同,所以没有固定的旷课次数适用于所有情况。</p>\n<p>Each instructor is responsible for making clear to the class at the beginning of the semester his or her policies and procedures in regard to class attendance and the reasons for them.</p>\n<p>每位教师都有责任在学期开始时向全班学生说明自己关于课堂出勤的政策和程序以及制定这些政策的原因。</p>",
