      "title": "Egg-eating Snakes",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Egg-eating snakes are a small group of snakes whose <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"saliva\">saliva</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"open\">open</option><option value=\"taste\">taste</option><option value=\"diet\">diet</option><option value=\"whole\">whole</option><option value=\"treatment\">treatment</option><option value=\"out\">out</option></select> consists only of eggs. Some eat only small eggs, which they have to swallow <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"saliva\">saliva</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"open\">open</option><option value=\"taste\">taste</option><option value=\"diet\">diet</option><option value=\"whole\">whole</option><option value=\"treatment\">treatment</option><option value=\"out\">out</option></select> , as the snake has no teeth. Instead, some other snakes eat bigger eggs, but it requires special <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"saliva\">saliva</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"open\">open</option><option value=\"taste\">taste</option><option value=\"diet\">diet</option><option value=\"whole\">whole</option><option value=\"treatment\">treatment</option><option value=\"out\">out</option></select> . These snakes have spines that stick <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"saliva\">saliva</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"open\">open</option><option value=\"taste\">taste</option><option value=\"diet\">diet</option><option value=\"whole\">whole</option><option value=\"treatment\">treatment</option><option value=\"out\">out</option></select> from the backbone. The spines crack the egg <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"saliva\">saliva</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"open\">open</option><option value=\"taste\">taste</option><option value=\"diet\">diet</option><option value=\"whole\">whole</option><option value=\"treatment\">treatment</option><option value=\"out\">out</option></select> as it passes through the throat.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、diet</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `diet consists of` 构成固定搭配,意思是“饮食由......组成”。句子说明这类蛇的食物只由蛋组成。因此填 `diet`。</p>\n<p>2、whole</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `swallow whole` 构成固定搭配,意思是“整个吞下”。句子说明有些蛇没有牙,只能把小蛋整个吞下。因此填 `whole`。</p>\n<p>3、treatment</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `require special treatment` 构成固定搭配,意思是“需要特殊处理”。句子说明其他蛇吃更大的蛋时需要特殊处理。因此填 `treatment`。</p>\n<p>4、out</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `stick out` 构成固定搭配,意思是“伸出、突出”。句子说明这些蛇的脊柱上有向外突出的刺。因此填 `out`。</p>\n<p>5、open</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: `crack open` 构成固定搭配,意思是“使裂开、破开”。句子说明蛋经过喉咙时会被刺破开。因此填 `open`。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Egg-eating snakes are a small group of snakes whose diet consists only of eggs.</p>\n<p>蝮蛇是一小群只吃蛋的蛇。</p>\n<p>Some eat only small eggs, which they have to swallow whole , as the snake has no teeth.</p>\n<p>一些蛇只吃小蛋,因为它们必须整个吞下,因为蛇没有牙⻮。</p>\n<p>Instead, some other snakes eat bigger eggs, but it requires special treatment.</p>\n<p>相反,其他一些蛇吃更大的蛋,但这需要特殊处理。</p>\n<p>These snakes have spines that stick out from the backbone.</p>\n<p>这些蛇的脊柱上有刺。</p>\n<p>The spines crack the egg open as it passes through the throat.</p>\n<p>当蛋经过喉咙时,刺会把它打开。</p>",
