      "passage_html": "<p>For all his fame and Arab celebration, William Shakespeare remains a(n) <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"entitlements\">entitlements</option><option value=\"mysterious\">mysterious</option><option value=\"ubiquitous\">ubiquitous</option><option value=\"church\">church</option><option value=\"gaps\">gaps</option><option value=\"sources\">sources</option></select> figure with regards to personal history. There are just two primary <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"entitlements\">entitlements</option><option value=\"mysterious\">mysterious</option><option value=\"ubiquitous\">ubiquitous</option><option value=\"church\">church</option><option value=\"gaps\">gaps</option><option value=\"sources\">sources</option></select> for information on the Bard: his works, and various legal and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"entitlements\">entitlements</option><option value=\"mysterious\">mysterious</option><option value=\"ubiquitous\">ubiquitous</option><option value=\"church\">church</option><option value=\"gaps\">gaps</option><option value=\"sources\">sources</option></select> documents that have survived from Elizabethan times. Naturally, there are many <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"entitlements\">entitlements</option><option value=\"mysterious\">mysterious</option><option value=\"ubiquitous\">ubiquitous</option><option value=\"church\">church</option><option value=\"gaps\">gaps</option><option value=\"sources\">sources</option></select> in this body of information, which tells us little about Shakespeare the man.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、mysterious</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“remains a ______ figure with regards to personal history”。后文提到关于莎士比亚的个人信息只有两个主要来源，且存在许多空白，说明他在个人历史方面是一个“神秘的”人物。mysterious 意为“神秘的”，符合语义。因此填 mysterious。</p>\n<p>2、sources</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“two primary ______ for information”，sources of information 是固定搭配，意为“信息来源”。表示关于莎士比亚的信息只有两个主要来源。因此填 sources。</p>\n<p>3、church</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“legal and ______ documents”，legal and church documents 构成并列结构，意为“法律和教会文件”。表示莎士比亚的信息来源包括各种法律文件和教会文件。因此填 church。</p>\n<p>4、gaps</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“many ______ in this body of information”，gaps in information 是常见搭配，意为“信息的空白/缺失”。表示这些信息中存在许多空白。因此填 gaps。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>For all his fame and Arab celebration, William Shakespeare remains a(n) mysterious figure with regards to personal history.</p>\n<p>尽管威廉·莎士比亚享有盛名并受到阿拉伯的庆祝,他在个人历史方面仍然是一个神秘的人物。</p>\n<p>There are just two primary sources for information on the Bard: his works, and various legal and church documents that have survived from Elizabethan times.</p>\n<p>关于这位诗人的信息只有两个主要的来源:他的作品以及一些从伊丽莎白时代流传下来的法律和教会文件。</p>\n<p>Naturally, there are many gaps in this body of information, which tells us little about Shakespeare the man.</p>\n<p>自然,在这部分信息中存在许多空白,这些信息对莎士比亚这个人几乎没有帮助。</p>",
