      "title": "British Landscape",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The passage is about the separation of the British Isles from the continent. A continent once bordered with Britain has sunk, but not many people <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"suggest\">suggest</option><option value=\"reconstruct\">reconstruct</option><option value=\"dissolve\">dissolve</option><option value=\"realize\">realize</option><option value=\"entity\">entity</option><option value=\"country\">country</option><option value=\"evidence\">evidence</option><option value=\"provision\">provision</option><option value=\"reordering\">reordering</option></select> that Britain is a relatively recent <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"suggest\">suggest</option><option value=\"reconstruct\">reconstruct</option><option value=\"dissolve\">dissolve</option><option value=\"realize\">realize</option><option value=\"entity\">entity</option><option value=\"country\">country</option><option value=\"evidence\">evidence</option><option value=\"provision\">provision</option><option value=\"reordering\">reordering</option></select> . Scientists have been able to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"suggest\">suggest</option><option value=\"reconstruct\">reconstruct</option><option value=\"dissolve\">dissolve</option><option value=\"realize\">realize</option><option value=\"entity\">entity</option><option value=\"country\">country</option><option value=\"evidence\">evidence</option><option value=\"provision\">provision</option><option value=\"reordering\">reordering</option></select> this ancient continent with the help of modern technologies. However, no archaeological <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"suggest\">suggest</option><option value=\"reconstruct\">reconstruct</option><option value=\"dissolve\">dissolve</option><option value=\"realize\">realize</option><option value=\"entity\">entity</option><option value=\"country\">country</option><option value=\"evidence\">evidence</option><option value=\"provision\">provision</option><option value=\"reordering\">reordering</option></select> has ever been found to fully support this claim, leaving the mystery unresolved.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、realize</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“not many people ______ that...”，realize that... 是常见搭配，意为“意识到……”。表示没有多少人意识到英国是一个相对较新的实体。因此填 realize。</p>\n<p>2、entity</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“a relatively recent ______”，entity 意为“实体”。前文提到大陆与英国曾经相连，后文说科学家能够重建这片古老的大陆，说明英国作为一个独立的地理“实体”是相对较新的。因此填 entity。</p>\n<p>3、reconstruct</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“able to ______ this ancient continent”。本句内部信息完整：科学家借助现代技术，能够对这片古老的大陆进行“重建”。reconstruct 意为“重建”，符合单句内部的语义逻辑，无需依赖前后文线索进行判断。因此填 reconstruct。</p>\n<p>4、evidence</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“archaeological ______”，archaeological evidence 是常见搭配，意为“考古证据”。本句内部语义完整：从未找到任何考古证据来完全支持这一说法，留下这个谜团未被解开。仅凭本句即可判断需要填入表示“证据”的词，无需依赖前后文线索。因此填 evidence。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>The passage is about the separation of the British Isles from the continent.</p>\n<p>这篇文章讲的是不列颠群岛与欧洲大陆的分离。</p>\n<p>A continent once bordered with Britain has sunk, but not many people realize that Britain is a relatively recent entity.</p>\n<p>一片曾与英国相连的大陆已经沉没，但并没有多少人意识到英国是一个相对较新的实体。</p>\n<p>Scientists have been able to reconstruct this ancient continent with the help of modern technologies.</p>\n<p>科学家已经能够借助现代技术重建这片古老大陆。</p>\n<p>However, no archaeological evidence has ever been found to fully support this claim, leaving the mystery unresolved.</p>\n<p>然而，至今没有发现任何考古证据能够完全支持这一说法，因此这个谜团仍未解开。</p>",
