      "title": "Austria",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Since Austria sits at a high elevation and spends a quarter of the year under <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"snow\">snow</option><option value=\"shadow\">shadow</option><option value=\"extent\">extent</option><option value=\"dedicated\">dedicated</option><option value=\"summarized\">summarized</option><option value=\"containing\">containing</option><option value=\"country\">country</option></select> , it should come as no surprise that heating is a matter of considerable importance in the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"snow\">snow</option><option value=\"shadow\">shadow</option><option value=\"extent\">extent</option><option value=\"dedicated\">dedicated</option><option value=\"summarized\">summarized</option><option value=\"containing\">containing</option><option value=\"country\">country</option></select> . What may be surprising, however, is that Vienna ― a grand imperial city of music, art, and history ― actually boasts a museum <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"snow\">snow</option><option value=\"shadow\">shadow</option><option value=\"extent\">extent</option><option value=\"dedicated\">dedicated</option><option value=\"summarized\">summarized</option><option value=\"containing\">containing</option><option value=\"country\">country</option></select> specifically to heating systems.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、snow</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“spends a quarter of the year under ______”，前文提到奥地利位于高海拔地区，后文说供暖非常重要，因此一年中有四分之一的时间应该处于“雪”覆盖之下。snow 意为“雪”，符合逻辑。因此填 snow。</p>\n<p>2、country</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“in the ______”，前文一直在描述奥地利这个国家的情况，此处指供暖在这个“国家”中是非常重要的。country 意为“国家”，指代奥地利。因此填 country。</p>\n<p>3、dedicated</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“boasts a museum ______ specifically to heating systems”，dedicated to 是固定搭配，意为“专门用于……的/致力于……的”。表示维也纳拥有一座专门展示供暖系统的博物馆。因此填 dedicated。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Since Austria sits at a high elevation and spends a quarter of the year under snow,</p>\n<p>由于奥地利位于高海拔地区,且一年有四分之一时间处于雪下,因此,供暖在该国家中非常重要,这并不令人惊讶。</p>\n<p>it should come as no surprise that heating is a matter of considerable importance in the country.</p>\n<p>然而,令人惊讶的是,维也纳——这座充满音乐、艺术和历史的宏伟帝国城市</p>\n<p>What may be surprising, however, is that Vienna — a grand imperial city of music, art, and history — actually boasts a museum dedicated to heating systems.</p>\n<p>——实际上拥有一个专门致力于供暖系统的博物馆。</p>",
