      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Today, many companies emphasize <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"sustainability\">sustainability</option><option value=\"maintenance\">maintenance</option><option value=\"gauge\">gauge</option><option value=\"appliance\">appliance</option><option value=\"bargain\">bargain</option><option value=\"disposal\">disposal</option></select> in their operations. For example, packaging should be made from recyclable materials to ensure proper <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"sustainability\">sustainability</option><option value=\"maintenance\">maintenance</option><option value=\"gauge\">gauge</option><option value=\"appliance\">appliance</option><option value=\"bargain\">bargain</option><option value=\"disposal\">disposal</option></select> . In households, using energy-efficient kitchen <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"sustainability\">sustainability</option><option value=\"maintenance\">maintenance</option><option value=\"gauge\">gauge</option><option value=\"appliance\">appliance</option><option value=\"bargain\">bargain</option><option value=\"disposal\">disposal</option></select> helps reduce environmental impact.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、sustainability</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“many companies emphasize ______ in their operations”。后文提到包装应使用可回收材料、使用节能电器等，这些都是“可持续性”的体现。sustainability 意为“可持续性”，符合段落主题。因此填 sustainability。</p>\n<p>2、disposal</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“ensure proper ______”，proper disposal 是常见搭配，意为“妥善处理/正确处置”。表示使用可回收材料制作包装，以确保包装能够得到妥善处理。因此填 disposal。</p>\n<p>3、appliance</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“energy-efficient kitchen ______”，kitchen appliance 是常见搭配，意为“厨房电器/器具”。表示使用节能厨房电器有助于减少环境影响。因此填 appliance。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Today, many companies emphasize sustainability in their operations.</p>\n<p>如今，许多公司在运营中强调可持续性。</p>\n<p>For example, packaging should be made from recyclable materials to ensure proper disposal.</p>\n<p>例如，包装应由可回收材料制成，以确保能够得到妥善处理。</p>\n<p>In households, using energy-efficient kitchen appliance helps reduce environmental impact.</p>\n<p>在家庭中，使用节能厨房电器有助于减少环境影响。</p>",
