      "title": "Folklore",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Folklore, a modern term for the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"book\">book</option><option value=\"regime\">regime</option><option value=\"body\">body</option><option value=\"tradition\">tradition</option><option value=\"community\">community</option><option value=\"art\">art</option><option value=\"category\">category</option><option value=\"word\">word</option></select> of traditional customs, superstitions, stories, dances, and songs that have been adopted and maintained within a given <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"book\">book</option><option value=\"regime\">regime</option><option value=\"body\">body</option><option value=\"tradition\">tradition</option><option value=\"community\">community</option><option value=\"art\">art</option><option value=\"category\">category</option><option value=\"word\">word</option></select> by processes of repetition is not reliant on the written <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"book\">book</option><option value=\"regime\">regime</option><option value=\"body\">body</option><option value=\"tradition\">tradition</option><option value=\"community\">community</option><option value=\"art\">art</option><option value=\"category\">category</option><option value=\"word\">word</option></select> . Along with folk songs and folktales, this broad <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"book\">book</option><option value=\"regime\">regime</option><option value=\"body\">body</option><option value=\"tradition\">tradition</option><option value=\"community\">community</option><option value=\"art\">art</option><option value=\"category\">category</option><option value=\"word\">word</option></select> of cultural forms embraces all kinds of legends, riddles, jokes, proverbs, games, charms, omens, spells, and rituals, especially those of pre-literate societies or social classes. Those forms of verbal expression that are handed on from one generation or locality to the next by word of mouth are said to constitute an oral <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"book\">book</option><option value=\"regime\">regime</option><option value=\"body\">body</option><option value=\"tradition\">tradition</option><option value=\"community\">community</option><option value=\"art\">art</option><option value=\"category\">category</option><option value=\"word\">word</option></select> .</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、body</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the ______ of traditional customs”，the body of 是固定搭配，意为“……的整体/主体”。表示民俗是传统习俗、迷信、故事等的整体。因此填 body。</p>\n<p>2、community</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“within a given ______”，given community 意为“特定的社群/社区”。表示这些习俗在特定社群中被采纳和维持。因此填 community。</p>\n<p>3、word</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the written ______”，written word 是固定搭配，意为“书面语言/文字”。表示民俗不依赖于文字。因此填 word。</p>\n<p>4、category</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“this broad ______ of cultural forms”，前文列举了民俗包含的各种形式（习俗、迷信、故事、舞蹈、歌曲等），此处说这一广泛的“类别”还包括其他形式。category 意为“类别”，与后面的 of cultural forms 搭配。因此填 category。</p>\n<p>5、tradition</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“oral ______”，oral tradition 是固定搭配，意为“口头传统”。表示通过口口相传的表达形式构成了口头传统。因此填 tradition。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Folklore, a modern term for the body of traditional customs, superstitions, stories, dances, and songs that have been adopted and maintained within a given community by processes of repetition is not reliant on the written word .</p>\n<p>⺠俗,是一个现代术语,指通过重复过程在特定社区中采纳和保持的传统习俗、迷信、故事、舞蹈和歌曲,不依赖文字。</p>\n<p>Along with folk songs and folktales, this broad category of cultural forms embraces all kinds of legends, riddles, jokes, proverbs, games, charms, omens, spells, and rituals, especially those of pre-literate societies or social classes.</p>\n<p>除了⺠歌和⺠间传说,这一广泛的文化形式类别包括各种传奇、谜语、笑话、谚语、游戏、符咒、预兆、咒语和仪式,特别是前文明社会或社会阶层的。</p>\n<p>Those forms of verbal expression that are handed on from one generation or locality to the next by word of mouth are said to constitute an oral tradition .</p>\n<p>那些通过口头从一代或一地传到另一代的口头表达方式,被称为构成口头传统。</p>",
