      "title": "Accounting and Finance",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>While accounting focuses on the day-to-day management of financial <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"editorials\">editorials</option><option value=\"knowledge\">knowledge</option><option value=\"analyzing\">analyzing</option><option value=\"announce\">announce</option><option value=\"project\">project</option><option value=\"using\">using</option><option value=\"content\">content</option><option value=\"reports\">reports</option></select> and records across the business world, finance uses this same information to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"editorials\">editorials</option><option value=\"knowledge\">knowledge</option><option value=\"analyzing\">analyzing</option><option value=\"announce\">announce</option><option value=\"project\">project</option><option value=\"using\">using</option><option value=\"content\">content</option><option value=\"reports\">reports</option></select> future growth and to analyze expenditure in order to strategize company finances. By studying this major you get to have a better insight on the market, with the right <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"editorials\">editorials</option><option value=\"knowledge\">knowledge</option><option value=\"analyzing\">analyzing</option><option value=\"announce\">announce</option><option value=\"project\">project</option><option value=\"using\">using</option><option value=\"content\">content</option><option value=\"reports\">reports</option></select> and skills acquired you should be able then when you graduate to advise others in making strong investments. This major will help you gain responsibility of predicting and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"editorials\">editorials</option><option value=\"knowledge\">knowledge</option><option value=\"analyzing\">analyzing</option><option value=\"announce\">announce</option><option value=\"project\">project</option><option value=\"using\">using</option><option value=\"content\">content</option><option value=\"reports\">reports</option></select> the potential for profit and growth, assessing monetary resources, utilizing accounting statistics and reports, and also looking externally for future funding options.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、reports</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 这里看并列关系:`reports and/or ...` 在词性和语义上保持一致。原句相关表达是“While accounting focuses on the day-to-day management of financial reports and records across the business world, finance uses this same information to”,填 `reports` 后,并列结构完整。</p>\n<p>2、project</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说当会计专注于商业世界中财务报告和记录的日常管理时,。project 表示“项目”,符合该句语境,因此填 `project`。</p>\n<p>3、knowledge</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 这里看并列关系:`knowledge and/or ...` 在词性和语义上保持一致。原句相关表达是“this major you get to have a better insight on the market, with the right knowledge and skills acquired you should be able then when you graduate to advise others in”,填 `knowledge` 后,并列结构完整。</p>\n<p>4、analyzing</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 这里看并列关系:`... and/or analyzing` 在词性和语义上保持一致。原句相关表达是“investments. This major will help you gain responsibility of predicting and analyzing the potential for profit and growth, assessing monetary resources, utilizing”,填 `analyzing` 后,并列结构完整。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>While accounting focuses on the day-to-day management of financial reports and records across the business world,</p>\n<p>当会计专注于商业世界中财务报告和记录的日常管理时,</p>\n<p>finance uses this same information to project future growth and to analyze expenditure in order to strategize company finances.</p>\n<p>财务则利用这些信息来预测未来的增长并分析支出,以策划公司财务战略。</p>\n<p>By studying this major you get to have a better insight on the market,</p>\n<p>通过学习这个专业,你对市场有更深的理解,</p>\n<p>with the right knowledge and skills acquired you should be able then when you graduate to advise others in making strong investments.</p>\n<p>掌握正确的知识和技能后,你应在毕业时有能力为他人提供投资建议。</p>\n<p>This major will help you gain responsibility of predicting and analyzing the potential for profit and growth,</p>\n<p>这个专业将帮助你获得预测和分析潜在利润和增长的责任,</p>\n<p>assessing monetary resources, utilizing accounting statistics and reports, and also looking externally for future funding options.</p>\n<p>评估货币资源,利用会计统计数据和报告,并对外寻求未来的融资方案。</p>",
