      "passage_html": "<p>While <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"along\">along</option><option value=\"with\">with</option><option value=\"few\">few</option><option value=\"lot\">lot</option><option value=\"many\">many</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"alongside\">alongside</option><option value=\"facilitate\">facilitate</option></select> businesses struggle to adapt in today's competitive market, only a <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"along\">along</option><option value=\"with\">with</option><option value=\"few\">few</option><option value=\"lot\">lot</option><option value=\"many\">many</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"alongside\">alongside</option><option value=\"facilitate\">facilitate</option></select> have managed to truly <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"along\">along</option><option value=\"with\">with</option><option value=\"few\">few</option><option value=\"lot\">lot</option><option value=\"many\">many</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"alongside\">alongside</option><option value=\"facilitate\">facilitate</option></select> . Those that succeed often work alongside innovative partners who help <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"along\">along</option><option value=\"with\">with</option><option value=\"few\">few</option><option value=\"lot\">lot</option><option value=\"many\">many</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"alongside\">alongside</option><option value=\"facilitate\">facilitate</option></select> growth through collaboration and shared resources. Thriving in such environments requires not only resilience but also the ability to adapt and work effectively <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"along\">along</option><option value=\"with\">with</option><option value=\"few\">few</option><option value=\"lot\">lot</option><option value=\"many\">many</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"alongside\">alongside</option><option value=\"facilitate\">facilitate</option></select> others.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、many</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“While ______ businesses struggle to adapt”，后文用 only a few 形成对比。While 表示转折对比关系，前句说“许多”企业挣扎求生，后句说只有“少数”真正繁荣。因此填 many。</p>\n<p>2、few</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“only a ______ have managed to truly...”，only a few 是固定搭配，意为“只有少数”。表示只有少数企业真正实现了繁荣。因此填 few。</p>\n<p>3、thrive</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“truly ______”，thrive 意为“繁荣/兴旺”。表示只有少数企业真正实现了繁荣，与后文 thriving in such environments 形成呼应。因此填 thrive。</p>\n<p>4、facilitate</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“help ______ growth”，facilitate growth 是常见搭配，意为“促进增长”。表示与创新伙伴合作能够帮助促进增长。因此填 facilitate。</p>\n<p>5、alongside</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“work effectively ______ others”，work alongside others 是常见搭配，意为“与他人并肩工作/与他人合作”。表示能够在竞争环境中与他人有效合作。因此填 alongside。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>While many businesses struggle to adapt in today's competitive market, only a few have managed to truly thrive.</p>\n<p>虽然许多企业在当今竞争激烈的市场中艰难适应，但只有少数企业真正实现了繁荣。</p>\n<p>Those that succeed often work alongside innovative partners who help facilitate growth through collaboration and shared resources.</p>\n<p>那些成功的企业往往会与创新型合作伙伴并肩合作，通过协作和共享资源来促进增长。</p>\n<p>Thriving in such environments requires not only resilience but also the ability to adapt and work effectively alongside others.</p>\n<p>在这样的环境中蓬勃发展不仅需要韧性，还需要适应能力以及与他人有效合作的能力。</p>",
