      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The increasing darkness in the Northern Hemisphere this time of year indicates to the plant that <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"autumn\">autumn</option><option value=\"reassess\">reassess</option><option value=\"summer\">summer</option><option value=\"salvage\">salvage</option><option value=\"slimy\">slimy</option><option value=\"leaves\">leaves</option><option value=\"roots\">roots</option><option value=\"waxy\">waxy</option><option value=\"shed\">shed</option></select> is coming on. So it starts recouping materials from the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"autumn\">autumn</option><option value=\"reassess\">reassess</option><option value=\"summer\">summer</option><option value=\"salvage\">salvage</option><option value=\"slimy\">slimy</option><option value=\"leaves\">leaves</option><option value=\"roots\">roots</option><option value=\"waxy\">waxy</option><option value=\"shed\">shed</option></select> before they drop off. Evergreens protect their needle-like foliage from freezing with <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"autumn\">autumn</option><option value=\"reassess\">reassess</option><option value=\"summer\">summer</option><option value=\"salvage\">salvage</option><option value=\"slimy\">slimy</option><option value=\"leaves\">leaves</option><option value=\"roots\">roots</option><option value=\"waxy\">waxy</option><option value=\"shed\">shed</option></select> coatings and natural &quot;antifreeze.&quot; But broadleaf plants, like sugar maples, birches, and sumacs, have no such protections. As a result, they <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"autumn\">autumn</option><option value=\"reassess\">reassess</option><option value=\"summer\">summer</option><option value=\"salvage\">salvage</option><option value=\"slimy\">slimy</option><option value=\"leaves\">leaves</option><option value=\"roots\">roots</option><option value=\"waxy\">waxy</option><option value=\"shed\">shed</option></select> their leaves. But before they do, the plants first try to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"autumn\">autumn</option><option value=\"reassess\">reassess</option><option value=\"summer\">summer</option><option value=\"salvage\">salvage</option><option value=\"slimy\">slimy</option><option value=\"leaves\">leaves</option><option value=\"roots\">roots</option><option value=\"waxy\">waxy</option><option value=\"shed\">shed</option></select> important nutrients such as nitrogen and phosphorus.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、autumn</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“indicates to the plant that ______ is coming on”。前文提到北半球此时黑暗逐渐增加，后文说植物开始从叶子中回收物质然后落叶。这些现象都表明“秋季”即将到来。因此填 autumn。</p>\n<p>2、leaves</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“recouping materials from the ______ before they drop off”。后文提到 broadleaf plants 会 shed their leaves（落叶），说明此处植物是从“叶子”中回收物质。因此填 leaves。</p>\n<p>3、waxy</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“with ______ coatings”，waxy coatings 是常见搭配，意为“蜡质涂层”。表示常绿植物通过蜡质涂层和天然“防冻剂”来保护针叶不被冻住。因此填 waxy。</p>\n<p>4、shed</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“they ______ their leaves”，shed leaves 是常见搭配，意为“落叶”。表示 broadleaf plants 没有保护措施，因此会落叶。因此填 shed。</p>\n<p>5、salvage</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“first try to ______ important nutrients”。前文提到植物在落叶前会从叶子中回收物质，此处具体说明它们试图“回收/挽救”氮、磷等重要营养物质。salvage 意为“回收/挽救”，符合语义。因此填 salvage。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>The increasing darkness in the Northern Hemisphere this time of year indicates to the plant that autumn is coming on.</p>\n<p>今年这个时候,北半球日益增加的黑夜向植物预示着秋天的到来。</p>\n<p>So it starts recouping materials from the leaves before they drop off.</p>\n<p>因此,它会在叶子掉落之前开始从叶子中回收材料。</p>\n<p>Evergreens protect their needle-like foliage from freezing with waxy coatings and natural \"antifreeze.\" But broadleaf plants, like sugar maples, birches, and sumacs, have no such protections.</p>\n<p>常绿植物会通过蜡质涂层和天然的“防冻剂”来保护其针状叶片免受冻结。</p>\n<p>As a result, they shed their leaves.</p>\n<p>但是,像糖枫、桦树和漆树这样的阔叶植物却没有这样的保护。</p>\n<p>But before they do, the plants first try to salvage important nutrients such as</p>\n<p>因此,他们失去了叶子。</p>\n<p>nitrogen and phosphorus.</p>\n<p>但是,在此之前,植物首先会尝试挽救重要的营养物质,例如氮和磷。</p>",
