      "passage_html": "<p>We <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"understanding\">understanding</option><option value=\"think\">think</option><option value=\"completing\">completing</option><option value=\"work\">work</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"build\">build</option><option value=\"solving\">solving</option><option value=\"lift\">lift</option></select> anyone can excel with the right foundation. By <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"understanding\">understanding</option><option value=\"think\">think</option><option value=\"completing\">completing</option><option value=\"work\">work</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"build\">build</option><option value=\"solving\">solving</option><option value=\"lift\">lift</option></select> the basis of information setting for knowledge, such as coding and other skills, participants gain essential expertise. Through 9-12 projects, you will <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"understanding\">understanding</option><option value=\"think\">think</option><option value=\"completing\">completing</option><option value=\"work\">work</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"build\">build</option><option value=\"solving\">solving</option><option value=\"lift\">lift</option></select> your portfolio, and upon <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"understanding\">understanding</option><option value=\"think\">think</option><option value=\"completing\">completing</option><option value=\"work\">work</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"build\">build</option><option value=\"solving\">solving</option><option value=\"lift\">lift</option></select> the program, you will have a robust showcase of your abilities.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、believe</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“We ______ anyone can excel...”，此处动词后接宾语从句。believe 可接 that 从句（that 可省略），表示“相信”。因此填 believe。</p>\n<p>2、understanding</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“By ______ the basis...”，By 是介词，后接动名词作宾语，表示“通过……方式”。因此填 understanding。</p>\n<p>3、build</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“you will ______ your portfolio”。本句内部语义完整：通过完成9-12个项目，你将“建立”你的作品集。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“构建/建立”的词。因此填 build。</p>\n<p>4、completing</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“upon ______ the program”，upon 是介词，后接动名词，表示“在……之后”。upon completing 意为“在完成……之后”。因此填 completing。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>We believe anyone can excel with the right foundation.</p>\n<p>我们相信任何人在拥有正确基础的情况下都能出类拔萃。</p>\n<p>By understanding the basis of information setting for knowledge, such as coding and other skills, participants gain essential expertise.</p>\n<p>通过理解知识的信息基础设置,例如编码和其他技能,参与者获得必要的专业知识。</p>\n<p>Through 9-12 projects, you will build your portfolio, and upon completing the program, you will have a robust showcase of your abilities.</p>\n<p>通过9到12个项目,你将建立你的作品集,并在完成该项目后,你将拥有一个展示自己能力的强大作品集。</p>",
