      "passage_html": "<p>If you are interested in studying but have other <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"opportunities\">opportunities</option><option value=\"rate\">rate</option><option value=\"charges\">charges</option><option value=\"mode\">mode</option><option value=\"modules\">modules</option><option value=\"commitments\">commitments</option><option value=\"requirements\">requirements</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option></select> , our online and distance learning courses offer an alternative flexible <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"opportunities\">opportunities</option><option value=\"rate\">rate</option><option value=\"charges\">charges</option><option value=\"mode\">mode</option><option value=\"modules\">modules</option><option value=\"commitments\">commitments</option><option value=\"requirements\">requirements</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option></select> of study. Teaching is conducted through a mixture of audio-visual, written and interactive materials. There are also <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"opportunities\">opportunities</option><option value=\"rate\">rate</option><option value=\"charges\">charges</option><option value=\"mode\">mode</option><option value=\"modules\">modules</option><option value=\"commitments\">commitments</option><option value=\"requirements\">requirements</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option></select> for online discussion and collaborative projects with tutors and other students. Some programmes include residential <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"opportunities\">opportunities</option><option value=\"rate\">rate</option><option value=\"charges\">charges</option><option value=\"mode\">mode</option><option value=\"modules\">modules</option><option value=\"commitments\">commitments</option><option value=\"requirements\">requirements</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option></select> taught on campus, giving you the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"opportunities\">opportunities</option><option value=\"rate\">rate</option><option value=\"charges\">charges</option><option value=\"mode\">mode</option><option value=\"modules\">modules</option><option value=\"commitments\">commitments</option><option value=\"requirements\">requirements</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option></select> to meet and work alongside your tutors and fellow students face-to-face. Our Graduate School provides comprehensive support for distance and part-time researchers, many of whom study for up to six years or more.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、commitments</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说如果你对学习感兴趣,但又有很多其他事情要处理,我们的在线和远程学习课程提供了一个替代的灵活学习方式。commitments 表示“事务/责任”,符合该句语境,因此填 `commitments`。</p>\n<p>2、mode</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说如果你对学习感兴趣,但又有很多其他事情要处理,我们的在线和远程学习课程提供了一个替代的灵活学习方式。mode 表示“模式”,符合该句语境,因此填 `mode`。</p>\n<p>3、opportunities</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说也有机会在网上进行讨论,与导师和其他学生合作完成项目。opportunities 表示“机会”,符合该句语境,因此填 `opportunities`。</p>\n<p>4、modules</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说一些课程包括在校园内教授的住宿模块,使你有机会与导师和同学面对面交流和合作。residential modules 表示“模块相关的表达”,符合该句语境,因此填 `modules`。</p>\n<p>5、chance</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 句子说一些课程包括在校园内教授的住宿模块,使你有机会与导师和同学面对面交流和合作。chance 表示“机会”,符合该句语境,因此填 `chance`。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>If you are interested in studying but have other commitments , our online and distance learning courses offer an alternative flexible mode of study.</p>\n<p>如果你对学习感兴趣,但又有很多其他事情要处理,我们的在线和远程学习课程提供了一个替代的灵活学习方式。</p>\n<p>Teaching is conducted through a mixture of audio-visual, written and interactive materials.</p>\n<p>教学是通过视听、书面和互动材料的混合进行的。</p>\n<p>There are also opportunities for online discussion and collaborative projects with tutors and other students.</p>\n<p>也有机会在网上进行讨论,与导师和其他学生合作完成项目。</p>\n<p>Some programmes include residential modules taught on campus, giving you the chance to meet and work alongside your tutors and fellow students face-to- face.</p>\n<p>一些课程包括在校园内教授的住宿模块,使你有机会与导师和同学面对面交流和合作。</p>\n<p>Our Graduate School provides comprehensive support for distance and part- time researchers, many of whom study for up to six years or more.</p>\n<p>我们的研究生院为远程和兼职研究人员提供全面支持,其中许多人学习长达六年或更长时间。</p>",
