      "id": "fib-r-5may-high-129",
      "question_id": 129,
      "title": "Long-term Goal",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The long-term goal can be divided into short-term goals that are <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"naturalistic\">naturalistic</option><option value=\"along the way\">along the way</option><option value=\"action\">action</option><option value=\"in order to\">in order to</option><option value=\"frequent\">frequent</option><option value=\"subsequence\">subsequence</option><option value=\"realistic\">realistic</option></select> and achievable. For example, <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"naturalistic\">naturalistic</option><option value=\"along the way\">along the way</option><option value=\"action\">action</option><option value=\"in order to\">in order to</option><option value=\"frequent\">frequent</option><option value=\"subsequence\">subsequence</option><option value=\"realistic\">realistic</option></select> achieve a high grade, you need to set short-term objectives such as studying regularly, completing assignments on time, and actively participating in class. Achieving these short-term goals along the way will help you reach your long-term goal. And, timely<select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"naturalistic\">naturalistic</option><option value=\"along the way\">along the way</option><option value=\"action\">action</option><option value=\"in order to\">in order to</option><option value=\"frequent\">frequent</option><option value=\"subsequence\">subsequence</option><option value=\"realistic\">realistic</option></select> on feedback also plays an important role in this process.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、realistic</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“goals that are ______ and achievable”。“and”连接两个并列的形容词，共同描述目标的特征。根据并列结构的一致性，空格应填入与 achievable 词性相同且语义相近的形容词。realistic 意为“现实可行的”，符合语境。因此填 realistic。</p>\n<p>2、in order to</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ achieve a high grade”。in order to 是固定搭配，意为“为了”，后接动词原形，表示目的。因此填 in order to。</p>\n<p>3、action</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“timely ______ on feedback”。本句内部语义完整：根据反馈采取及时的“行动”在这个过程中也起着重要作用。仅凭本句即可判断需要填名词，因为timely是形容词，表及时的；因此填 action。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>The long-term goal can be divided into short-term goals that are realistic and achievable.</p>\n<p>长期目标可以被分解为现实且可以实现的短期目标。</p>\n<p>For example, in order to achieve a high grade, you need to set short-term objectives such as studying regularly, completing assignments on time, and actively participating in class.</p>\n<p>例如,为了取得高分,你需要设定短期目标,比如定期学习、按时完成作业以及积极参与课堂活动。</p>\n<p>And, timely action on feedback also plays an important role in this process.</p>\n<p>此外,及时根据反馈采取行动在这个过程中也起着重要作用。</p>",
