      "title": "Talking",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Talking is not just an activity of the vocal <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"others\">others</option><option value=\"well-being\">well-being</option><option value=\"foreigners\">foreigners</option><option value=\"practitioners\">practitioners</option><option value=\"ties\">ties</option><option value=\"operations\">operations</option><option value=\"bureaucrats\">bureaucrats</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"cords\">cords</option><option value=\"tracts\">tracts</option></select> , it is a way of connecting with ourselves and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"others\">others</option><option value=\"well-being\">well-being</option><option value=\"foreigners\">foreigners</option><option value=\"practitioners\">practitioners</option><option value=\"ties\">ties</option><option value=\"operations\">operations</option><option value=\"bureaucrats\">bureaucrats</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"cords\">cords</option><option value=\"tracts\">tracts</option></select> that creates a culture of health and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"others\">others</option><option value=\"well-being\">well-being</option><option value=\"foreigners\">foreigners</option><option value=\"practitioners\">practitioners</option><option value=\"ties\">ties</option><option value=\"operations\">operations</option><option value=\"bureaucrats\">bureaucrats</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"cords\">cords</option><option value=\"tracts\">tracts</option></select> . Specifically, speaking with healthcare <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"others\">others</option><option value=\"well-being\">well-being</option><option value=\"foreigners\">foreigners</option><option value=\"practitioners\">practitioners</option><option value=\"ties\">ties</option><option value=\"operations\">operations</option><option value=\"bureaucrats\">bureaucrats</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"cords\">cords</option><option value=\"tracts\">tracts</option></select> about health worries, and more generally opening up to create more and stronger social <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"others\">others</option><option value=\"well-being\">well-being</option><option value=\"foreigners\">foreigners</option><option value=\"practitioners\">practitioners</option><option value=\"ties\">ties</option><option value=\"operations\">operations</option><option value=\"bureaucrats\">bureaucrats</option><option value=\"medicine\">medicine</option><option value=\"cords\">cords</option><option value=\"tracts\">tracts</option></select> ,can have many positive benefits.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、cords</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“vocal ______”，vocal cords 是固定搭配，意为“声带”。表示说话不仅仅是声带的活动。因此填 cords。</p>\n<p>2、others</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“connecting with ourselves and ______”。本句内部语义完整：与自己及“他人”建立联系。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“他人”的词。因此填 others。</p>\n<p>3、well-being</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“a culture of health and ______”。本句内部语义完整：创造健康与“幸福”的文化。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“幸福/福祉”的词。因此填 well-being。</p>\n<p>4、practitioners</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“healthcare ______”。后文提到“about health worries”，说明是谈论健康担忧，因此需要表示“医疗从业者”的词。因此填 practitioners。</p>\n<p>5、ties</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“stronger social ______”。本句内部语义完整：建立更多更强的社会“联系”。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“联系/纽带”的词。因此填 ties。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Talking is not just an activity of the vocal cords.</p>\n<p>说话不仅仅是声带的活动。</p>\n<p>It is a way of connecting with ourselves and others that creates a culture of health and well-being.</p>\n<p>它是连接自我和他人的方式,创造健康和福祉的文化。</p>\n<p>Specifically, speaking with healthcare practitioners about health worries.</p>\n<p>具体来说,与医疗保健专业人士讨论健康担忧。</p>\n<p>and more generally opening up to create more and stronger social ties.</p>\n<p>更普遍地说,开放自己创造更多、更牢固的社会联系。</p>\n<p>can have many positive benefits.</p>\n<p>这可以带来许多积极的好处。</p>",
