      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Digital media and the internet have made the sharing of texts, music and images easier than ever, and the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"creativity\">creativity</option><option value=\"changed\">changed</option><option value=\"enforcement\">enforcement</option><option value=\"advocates\">advocates</option><option value=\"challenges\">challenges</option><option value=\"enactment\">enactment</option><option value=\"conformity\">conformity</option></select> of copyright restriction harder. This situation has encouraged the growth of IP law, and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"creativity\">creativity</option><option value=\"changed\">changed</option><option value=\"enforcement\">enforcement</option><option value=\"advocates\">advocates</option><option value=\"challenges\">challenges</option><option value=\"enactment\">enactment</option><option value=\"conformity\">conformity</option></select> increased industrial concentration on extending and 'policing' IP protection, while also leading to the growth of an 'open access', or 'creative commons' movement which <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"creativity\">creativity</option><option value=\"changed\">changed</option><option value=\"enforcement\">enforcement</option><option value=\"advocates\">advocates</option><option value=\"challenges\">challenges</option><option value=\"enactment\">enactment</option><option value=\"conformity\">conformity</option></select> such control of knowledge and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"creativity\">creativity</option><option value=\"changed\">changed</option><option value=\"enforcement\">enforcement</option><option value=\"advocates\">advocates</option><option value=\"challenges\">challenges</option><option value=\"enactment\">enactment</option><option value=\"conformity\">conformity</option></select> .</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、enforcement</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the ______ of copyright restriction”。本句内部语义完整：数字媒体使得版权限制的“执行”更加困难。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“执行/实施”的词。因此填 enforcement。</p>\n<p>2、prompted</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“has ______ increased industrial concentration”。本句内部语义完整：这种情况“促使”了工业集中度的增加。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“导致/促使”的词。因此填 prompted。</p>\n<p>3、challenges</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“which ______ such control of knowledge”。本句内部语义完整：“开放获取”运动“挑战”这种对知识的控制。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“挑战”的词。因此填 challenges。</p>\n<p>4、creativity</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“knowledge and ______”，knowledge and creativity 由 and 连接，构成并列结构。因此填 creativity。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Digital media and the internet have made the sharing of texts, music and images easier than ever, and the enforcement of copyright restriction harder.</p>\n<p>数字媒体和互联网使文本、音乐和图像的共享变得前所未有的容易,而使执行版权限制变得困难。</p>\n<p>This situation has encouraged the growth of IP law, and prompted increased industrial concentration on extending and 'policing' IP protection, while also leading to the growth of an 'open access', or 'creative commons' movement which challenges such control of knowledge and creativity .</p>\n<p>这种情况鼓励了知识产权法的增⻓,促使工业集中更多精力在扩大和“管理”知识产权保护上,同时也导致了“开放访问”或“创意共享”运动的增⻓,这些运动挑战了这种对知识和创造力的控制。</p>",
