      "id": "fib-r-5may-high-350",
      "question_id": 350,
      "title": "Carski Award",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>In 2001 he received the SIUC Outstanding Scholar Award. In 2003 he received the Carski Award for Distinguished Undergraduate Teaching from the American Society for Microbiology. Mike's research is <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"focused\">focused</option><option value=\"interests\">interests</option><option value=\"extreme\">extreme</option><option value=\"journey\">journey</option><option value=\"treatise\">treatise</option><option value=\"separated\">separated</option><option value=\"profits\">profits</option><option value=\"treaty\">treaty</option><option value=\"journal\">journal</option><option value=\"moderate\">moderate</option></select> on bacteria that inhabit <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"focused\">focused</option><option value=\"interests\">interests</option><option value=\"extreme\">extreme</option><option value=\"journey\">journey</option><option value=\"treatise\">treatise</option><option value=\"separated\">separated</option><option value=\"profits\">profits</option><option value=\"treaty\">treaty</option><option value=\"journal\">journal</option><option value=\"moderate\">moderate</option></select> environments, and for the past 12 years he has studied the microbiology of permanently ice-covered lakes in the McMurdo Dry Valleys, Antarctica. In addition to his research papers, he has edited a major <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"focused\">focused</option><option value=\"interests\">interests</option><option value=\"extreme\">extreme</option><option value=\"journey\">journey</option><option value=\"treatise\">treatise</option><option value=\"separated\">separated</option><option value=\"profits\">profits</option><option value=\"treaty\">treaty</option><option value=\"journal\">journal</option><option value=\"moderate\">moderate</option></select> on phototrophic bacteria and served for over a decade as chief editor of the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"focused\">focused</option><option value=\"interests\">interests</option><option value=\"extreme\">extreme</option><option value=\"journey\">journey</option><option value=\"treatise\">treatise</option><option value=\"separated\">separated</option><option value=\"profits\">profits</option><option value=\"treaty\">treaty</option><option value=\"journal\">journal</option><option value=\"moderate\">moderate</option></select> Archives of Microbiology. He currently serves on the editorial board of Environmental Microbiology. Mike's non-scientific <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"focused\">focused</option><option value=\"interests\">interests</option><option value=\"extreme\">extreme</option><option value=\"journey\">journey</option><option value=\"treatise\">treatise</option><option value=\"separated\">separated</option><option value=\"profits\">profits</option><option value=\"treaty\">treaty</option><option value=\"journal\">journal</option><option value=\"moderate\">moderate</option></select> include forestry, reading, and caring for his dogs and horses. He lives beside a peaceful and quiet lake with his wife, Nancy, five shelter dogs (Gaino, Snuffy, Pepto, Peanut, and Merry), and four horses (Springer, Feivel, Gwen, and Festus).</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、focused</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“research is ______ on”，be focused on 是固定搭配，意为“专注于”。表示迈克的研究专注于栖息在极端环境中的细菌。因此填 focused。</p>\n<p>2、extreme</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“inhabit ______ environments”。本句内部语义完整：细菌栖息在“极端的”环境中。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“极端的”形容词。因此填 extreme。</p>\n<p>3、treatise</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“edited a major ______”。本句内部语义完整：他编辑了一本关于光合细菌的重要“专著”。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“专著/论文”的名词。因此填 treatise。</p>\n<p>4、journal</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“chief editor of the ______”。本句内部语义完整：他担任《微生物学档案》这本“期刊”的主编。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“期刊”的名词。因此填 journal。</p>\n<p>5、interests</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“non-scientific ______ include forestry, reading, and caring...”。include 后列举了 forestry、reading、caring for his dogs and horses，这些都是“兴趣爱好”的具体内容。因此填 interests。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>In 2001 he received the SIUC Outstanding Scholar Award. 2001</p>\n<p>年,他获得了 SIUC杰出学者奖。</p>\n<p>In 2003 he received the Carski Award for Distinguished Undergraduate Teaching from the American Society for Microbiology. 2003</p>\n<p>年,他获得了美国微</p>\n<p>Mike's research is focused on bacteria that inhabit extreme environments, and for the past 12 years he has studied the microbiology of permanently ice</p>\n<p>生物学会颁发的Carski杰出本科教学奖。</p>\n<p>covered lakes in the McMurdo Dry Valleys, Antarctica.</p>\n<p>迈克的研究集中在极端环</p>\n<p>In addition to his research papers, he has edited a major treatise on</p>\n<p>境中的细菌上,过去12年来,他一直在研究南极洲⻨克默多干燥谷中永久结冰湖泊的微生物学。</p>\n<p>phototrophic bacteria and served for over a decade as chief editor of the journal Archives of Microbiology.</p>\n<p>除了他的研究论文外,他还编辑了一本关于光合细菌的专著,并担任《微生物学档案》杂志的主编十多年。</p>\n<p>He currently serves on the editorial board of Environmental Microbiology.</p>\n<p>目前,他担任《环境微生物学》杂志的编辑委员会成员。</p>\n<p>Mike's non-scientific interests include forestry, reading, and caring for his dogs and horses.</p>\n<p>迈克的非科学兴趣包括林业、阅读和照顾他的狗和⻢。</p>\n<p>He lives beside a peaceful and quiet lake with his wife, Nancy, five shelter dogs (Gaino, Snuffy, Pepto, Peanut, and Merry), and four horses (Springer, Feivel,</p>\n<p>Gwen, and Festus). 他和妻子南希住在一个宁静的湖畔,有5只救助犬(盖诺、斯纳菲、派普托、花生和梅丽)和4匹⻢(斯普林格、费维尔、格温和</p>",
