      "title": "Wool Market",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The wool market was extremely important to the English medieval economy and wool <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"monopolized\">monopolized</option><option value=\"contrasts\">contrasts</option><option value=\"contracts\">contracts</option><option value=\"dominated\">dominated</option><option value=\"political\">political</option><option value=\"increase\">increase</option><option value=\"bureaucratic\">bureaucratic</option><option value=\"decline\">decline</option></select> the English export trade from the late-thirteenth century to its <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"monopolized\">monopolized</option><option value=\"contrasts\">contrasts</option><option value=\"contracts\">contracts</option><option value=\"dominated\">dominated</option><option value=\"political\">political</option><option value=\"increase\">increase</option><option value=\"bureaucratic\">bureaucratic</option><option value=\"decline\">decline</option></select> in the late-fifteenth century. Wool was at the forefront of the establishment of England as a European <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"monopolized\">monopolized</option><option value=\"contrasts\">contrasts</option><option value=\"contracts\">contracts</option><option value=\"dominated\">dominated</option><option value=\"political\">political</option><option value=\"increase\">increase</option><option value=\"bureaucratic\">bureaucratic</option><option value=\"decline\">decline</option></select> and economic power and this volume was the first study of the medieval wool market in over 20 years. It investigates in detail the scale and scope of advance <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"monopolized\">monopolized</option><option value=\"contrasts\">contrasts</option><option value=\"contracts\">contracts</option><option value=\"dominated\">dominated</option><option value=\"political\">political</option><option value=\"increase\">increase</option><option value=\"bureaucratic\">bureaucratic</option><option value=\"decline\">decline</option></select> for the sale of wool; the majority of these agreements were formed between English monasteries and Italian merchants, and the book focuses on the data contained within them.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、dominated</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“wool ______ the English export trade”。本句内部语义完整：羊毛“主导了”英国出口贸易。dominated 意为“主导/支配”，符合语义。因此填 dominated。</p>\n<p>2、decline</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“from its ______ in the late-fifteenth century”。本句内部语义完整：羊毛主导地位从13世纪末一直持续到15世纪后期的“衰落”。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“衰落”的名词。因此填 decline。</p>\n<p>3、political</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“as a European ______ and economic power”，political and economic 由 and 连接，构成并列结构，共同修饰 power。因此填 political。</p>\n<p>4、contracts</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“advance ______ for the sale of wool”。本句内部语义完整：它详</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>century to its decline in the late-fifteenth century.</p>\n<p>以下是将英文原文和中文译文一句英文一句中文对照的结果:中文:羊毛市场对英国中世纪经济具有重要意义,从13世纪末到15世纪末,羊毛是英国出口贸易的主导产品。</p>\n<p>the medieval wool market in over 20 years.</p>\n<p>中文:羊毛在英格兰成为欧洲政治和经济强国的过程中发挥了重要作用,本文是20多年来对中世纪羊毛市场的第一项研究。</p>\n<p>monasteries and Italian merchants, and the book focuses on the data contained within them.</p>\n<p>中文:它详细调查了预售羊毛合同的规模和范围;大多数协议是由英国修道院和意大利商人达成的,本书重点关注其中所包含的数据。</p>",
