      "title": "The World",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>A good way to make sure that people police themselves is to get them to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"profitable\">profitable</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"place\">place</option><option value=\"that\">that</option><option value=\"career\">career</option><option value=\"defy\">defy</option><option value=\"destroyed\">destroyed</option><option value=\"true\">true</option><option value=\"described\">described</option><option value=\"what\">what</option></select> essentially the same stories about what the world is and why the way it is good, <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"profitable\">profitable</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"place\">place</option><option value=\"that\">that</option><option value=\"career\">career</option><option value=\"defy\">defy</option><option value=\"destroyed\">destroyed</option><option value=\"true\">true</option><option value=\"described\">described</option><option value=\"what\">what</option></select> and beautiful. The world needs to be <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"profitable\">profitable</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"place\">place</option><option value=\"that\">that</option><option value=\"career\">career</option><option value=\"defy\">defy</option><option value=\"destroyed\">destroyed</option><option value=\"true\">true</option><option value=\"described\">described</option><option value=\"what\">what</option></select> , needs to be justified by arguments about nature, philosophical principle, history or the gods. People will find their <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"profitable\">profitable</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"place\">place</option><option value=\"that\">that</option><option value=\"career\">career</option><option value=\"defy\">defy</option><option value=\"destroyed\">destroyed</option><option value=\"true\">true</option><option value=\"described\">described</option><option value=\"what\">what</option></select> in such a world. They will learn <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"profitable\">profitable</option><option value=\"believe\">believe</option><option value=\"place\">place</option><option value=\"that\">that</option><option value=\"career\">career</option><option value=\"defy\">defy</option><option value=\"destroyed\">destroyed</option><option value=\"true\">true</option><option value=\"described\">described</option><option value=\"what\">what</option></select> hopes they might reasonably hold for themselves.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、believe</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“get them to ______ essentially the same stories”。本句内部语义完整：让他们“相信”关于世界的相同故事。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“相信”的动词。因此填 believe。</p>\n<p>2、true</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“good, ______ and beautiful”，good、true 和 beautiful 由逗号和 and 连接，构成并列结构。因此填 true。</p>\n<p>3、described</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“The world needs to be ______”，主语 The world 与 describe（描述）之间为被动关系，needs to be described 表示“需要被描述”。因此填 described。</p>\n<p>4、place</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“find their ______”，find one&#x27;s place 是固定搭配，意为“找到自己的位置/归属”。因此填 place。</p>\n<p>5、what</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“learn ______ hopes they might reasonably hold”，what 在此处作定语修饰 hopes，引导宾语从句，意为“什么样的希望”。因此填 what。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>A good way to make sure that people police themselves is to get them to</p>\n<p>好的,以下是按照中英文对照的方式排列的结果:保证人们自我约束的好方法是要让他们相信关于世界是什么以及为什么它的样子是好的、真实的和美丽的,这基本上是一样的故事。</p>\n<p>believe essentially the same stories about what the world is and why the way it is good, true and beautiful.</p>\n<p>世界需要描述,需要通过关于自然、哲学原理、历史或神明的论点来证明其合</p>\n<p>The world needs to be described , needs to be justified by arguments about nature, philosophical principle, history or the gods.</p>\n<p>理性。</p>\n<p>People will find their place in such a world.</p>\n<p>人们将在这个世界中找到自己的位置。</p>\n<p>They will learn what hopes they might reasonably hold for themselves.</p>\n<p>他们将学会他们可能对自己持有的合理希望是什么。</p>",
