          "explanation": "空格位于“attractiveness boosted interest but decreased perceived quality, ______ competence and morality were positively related...”，whereas 表示对比，意为“然而”。前句说吸引力提高了兴趣但降低了感知质量，然而能力和道德与两者都呈正相关。因此填 whereas。"
