      "id": "fib-r-5may-high-585",
      "question_id": 585,
      "title": "Animals' Role",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Animals have played a major role in human’s lives throughout history. Today, scientific research is trying to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"alternative\">alternative</option><option value=\"affection\">affection</option><option value=\"enhance\">enhance</option><option value=\"discover\">discover</option><option value=\"decisions\">decisions</option><option value=\"different\">different</option><option value=\"theorized\">theorized</option><option value=\"preferential\">preferential</option><option value=\"acclaimed\">acclaimed</option></select> the positive aspects of living with companion animals. Animals have been used as an <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"alternative\">alternative</option><option value=\"affection\">affection</option><option value=\"enhance\">enhance</option><option value=\"discover\">discover</option><option value=\"decisions\">decisions</option><option value=\"different\">different</option><option value=\"theorized\">theorized</option><option value=\"preferential\">preferential</option><option value=\"acclaimed\">acclaimed</option></select> form of treatment for many years. More recently it has been discovered that owning a pet can help lower people’s blood pressure, <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"alternative\">alternative</option><option value=\"affection\">affection</option><option value=\"enhance\">enhance</option><option value=\"discover\">discover</option><option value=\"decisions\">decisions</option><option value=\"different\">different</option><option value=\"theorized\">theorized</option><option value=\"preferential\">preferential</option><option value=\"acclaimed\">acclaimed</option></select> the chances of living after a heart attack, keep people more active and provide more satisfaction with life. It is <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"alternative\">alternative</option><option value=\"affection\">affection</option><option value=\"enhance\">enhance</option><option value=\"discover\">discover</option><option value=\"decisions\">decisions</option><option value=\"different\">different</option><option value=\"theorized\">theorized</option><option value=\"preferential\">preferential</option><option value=\"acclaimed\">acclaimed</option></select> that this happens because pets help people become more social, provide a means to give and receive <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"alternative\">alternative</option><option value=\"affection\">affection</option><option value=\"enhance\">enhance</option><option value=\"discover\">discover</option><option value=\"decisions\">decisions</option><option value=\"different\">different</option><option value=\"theorized\">theorized</option><option value=\"preferential\">preferential</option><option value=\"acclaimed\">acclaimed</option></select> , and help connect us with the natural world.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、discover</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“scientific research is trying to ______ the positive aspects”。本句内部语义完整：科学研究正试图“发现”与伴侣动物生活在一起的积极方面。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“发现/找到”的动词。因此填 discover。</p>\n<p>2、alternative</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“an ______ form of treatment”。本句内部语义完整：动物多年来一直被用作一种“替代性”治疗形式。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“替代的/非传统的”形容词。因此填 alternative。</p>\n<p>3、enhance</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ the chances of living after a heart attack”。本句内部语义完整：养宠物可以帮助“提高”心脏病发作后的生存几率。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“提高/增加”的动词。因此填 enhance。</p>\n<p>4、theorized</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“It is ______ that this happens because...”，It is theorized that... 是常见学术表达，意为“据理论推测……”。此处为“It + be + 过去分词 + that从句”的被动结构。因此填 theorized。</p>\n<p>5、affection</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“give and receive ______”。本句内部语义完整：宠物提供了一种给予和接收“情感/爱”的方式。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“情感/喜爱”的名词。因此填 affection。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Today, scientific research is trying to discover the positive aspects of living with companion animals.</p>\n<p>以下是将中英文对照的内容:历史⻓河中,动物在人类生活中一直扮演着重要⻆色。</p>\n<p>Animals have been used as an alternative form of treatment for many years.</p>\n<p>今天,科学研究正在尝试发现与伴侣动物生活在一起的积极方面。</p>\n<p>More recently it has been discovered that owning a pet can help lower people’s blood pressure, enhance the chances of living after a heart attack, keep people more active and provide more satisfaction with life.</p>\n<p>多年来,动物一直被用作替代治疗。</p>\n<p>It is theorized that this happens because pets help people become more social, provide a means to give and receive affection , and help connect us with the natural world.</p>\n<p>最近的研究发现,拥有宠物可以帮助人们降低血压,提高心脏病发作后的生存机会,让人们更活跃,让生活更满意。据推测,这是因为宠物可以帮助人们变得更社交,提供接受和给予关爱的手段,并帮助我们联系自然世界。</p>",
