      "passage_html": "<p>Higher education qualifications provide a substantial <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"aggressive\">aggressive</option><option value=\"workforce\">workforce</option><option value=\"weakness\">weakness</option><option value=\"grudge\">grudge</option><option value=\"competitive\">competitive</option><option value=\"tend\">tend</option><option value=\"graduates\">graduates</option><option value=\"advantage\">advantage</option></select> in the labour market. Higher education <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"aggressive\">aggressive</option><option value=\"workforce\">workforce</option><option value=\"weakness\">weakness</option><option value=\"grudge\">grudge</option><option value=\"competitive\">competitive</option><option value=\"tend\">tend</option><option value=\"graduates\">graduates</option><option value=\"advantage\">advantage</option></select> are less likely to be unemployed and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"aggressive\">aggressive</option><option value=\"workforce\">workforce</option><option value=\"weakness\">weakness</option><option value=\"grudge\">grudge</option><option value=\"competitive\">competitive</option><option value=\"tend\">tend</option><option value=\"graduates\">graduates</option><option value=\"advantage\">advantage</option></select> to have higher incomes than those without such qualifications. Having a highly educated <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"aggressive\">aggressive</option><option value=\"workforce\">workforce</option><option value=\"weakness\">weakness</option><option value=\"grudge\">grudge</option><option value=\"competitive\">competitive</option><option value=\"tend\">tend</option><option value=\"graduates\">graduates</option><option value=\"advantage\">advantage</option></select> can also lead to increased productivity and innovation and make Australia more <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"aggressive\">aggressive</option><option value=\"workforce\">workforce</option><option value=\"weakness\">weakness</option><option value=\"grudge\">grudge</option><option value=\"competitive\">competitive</option><option value=\"tend\">tend</option><option value=\"graduates\">graduates</option><option value=\"advantage\">advantage</option></select> in the global market.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、advantage</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“provide a substantial ______ in the labour market”，provide an advantage 是常见搭配，意为“提供优势”。因此填 advantage。</p>\n<p>2、graduates</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“Higher education ______ are less likely to be unemployed”，本句主语应为接受过高等教育的人。前文提到高等教育学历提供优势，后文说他们失业率更低，因此需要表示“毕业生”的词。因此填 graduates。</p>\n<p>3、tend</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“and ______ to have higher incomes”，tend to do sth. 是固定搭配，意为“倾向于做某事”。因此填 tend。</p>\n<p>4、workforce</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“Having a highly educated ______”，段落在讨论高等教育与劳动力市场的关系，这里自然引出“受过良好教育的劳动力”这一概念。因此填 workforce。</p>\n<p>5、competitive</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“make Australia more ______ in the global market”。本句内部信息完整：高学历劳动力带来生产力和创新，这一结果会使澳大利亚在全球市场更具“竞争力”。仅凭本句即可判断。因此填 competitive。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Higher education qualifications provide a substantial advantage in the labour market.</p>\n<p>高等教育资格为劳动力市场提供显著优势。</p>\n<p>Higher education graduates are less likely to be unemployed and tend to have higher incomes than those without such qualifications.</p>\n<p>高等教育毕业生不太可能失业,并且收入往往高于没有此类资格的人。</p>\n<p>Having a highly educated workforce can also lead to increased productivity and innovation and make Australia more competitive in the global market.</p>\n<p>拥有受过高等教育的劳动力队伍,还可以提高生产力和创新,使澳大利亚在全球市场上更具竞争力。</p>",
