      "id": "fib-r-5may-high-273",
      "question_id": 273,
      "title": "Musical",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>One of the most popular forms of theater is the musical. Combining drama, dance and music, the musical has been around for over a century, and in that time has kept pace with changing <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"revenues\">revenues</option><option value=\"tastes\">tastes</option><option value=\"impressions\">impressions</option><option value=\"technicians\">technicians</option><option value=\"conditions\">conditions</option><option value=\"sets\">sets</option><option value=\"advances\">advances</option><option value=\"resources\">resources</option><option value=\"forms\">forms</option></select> and social <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"revenues\">revenues</option><option value=\"tastes\">tastes</option><option value=\"impressions\">impressions</option><option value=\"technicians\">technicians</option><option value=\"conditions\">conditions</option><option value=\"sets\">sets</option><option value=\"advances\">advances</option><option value=\"resources\">resources</option><option value=\"forms\">forms</option></select> , as well as <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"revenues\">revenues</option><option value=\"tastes\">tastes</option><option value=\"impressions\">impressions</option><option value=\"technicians\">technicians</option><option value=\"conditions\">conditions</option><option value=\"sets\">sets</option><option value=\"advances\">advances</option><option value=\"resources\">resources</option><option value=\"forms\">forms</option></select> in theater technology. Many modern musicals are known for their spectacular <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"revenues\">revenues</option><option value=\"tastes\">tastes</option><option value=\"impressions\">impressions</option><option value=\"technicians\">technicians</option><option value=\"conditions\">conditions</option><option value=\"sets\">sets</option><option value=\"advances\">advances</option><option value=\"resources\">resources</option><option value=\"forms\">forms</option></select> , lighting and other effects.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、tastes</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“changing ______”，changing tastes 是常见搭配，意为“变化的口味/审美偏好”。表示音乐剧随着人们变化的口味而发展。因此填 tastes。</p>\n<p>2、conditions</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“social ______”，social conditions 是常见搭配，意为“社会状况/社会条件”。表示音乐剧也随着社会状况的变化而发展。因此填 conditions。</p>\n<p>3、advances</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“as well as ______ in theater technology”，advances in technology 是常见搭配，意为“技术上的进步”。表示音乐剧还随着剧院技术的进步而发展。因此填 advances。</p>\n<p>4、sets</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“spectacular ______, lighting and other effects”，sets 在此处意为“舞台布景”，与 lighting、effects 并列，都是剧院制作的组成部分。spectacular sets 意为“壮观的舞台布景”。因此填 sets。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>One of the most popular forms of theater is the musical.</p>\n<p>最受欢迎的剧场形式之一是音乐剧。</p>\n<p>Combining drama, dance and music, the musical has been around for over a century, and in that time has kept pace with changing tastes and social conditions, as well as advances in theater technology.</p>\n<p>音乐剧结合了戏剧、舞蹈和音乐，已经存在了一个多世纪，并在此期间跟上了不断变化的品味、社会条件以及剧场技术的进步。</p>\n<p>Many modern musicals are known for their spectacular sets, lighting and other effects.</p>\n<p>许多现代音乐剧以壮观的布景、灯光和其他效果而闻名。</p>",
