      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Walt Disney World has become a pilgrimage site partly because of the luminosity of its crosscultural and marketing and partly because its <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"sequential\">sequential</option><option value=\"utopian\">utopian</option><option value=\"population\">population</option><option value=\"comedy\">comedy</option><option value=\"society\">society</option><option value=\"unrealistic\">unrealistic</option><option value=\"childhood\">childhood</option><option value=\"educational\">educational</option></select> aspects appeal powerfully to real needs in the capitalist <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"sequential\">sequential</option><option value=\"utopian\">utopian</option><option value=\"population\">population</option><option value=\"comedy\">comedy</option><option value=\"society\">society</option><option value=\"unrealistic\">unrealistic</option><option value=\"childhood\">childhood</option><option value=\"educational\">educational</option></select> . Disney' s marketing is unique because it captured the symbolic essence of <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"sequential\">sequential</option><option value=\"utopian\">utopian</option><option value=\"population\">population</option><option value=\"comedy\">comedy</option><option value=\"society\">society</option><option value=\"unrealistic\">unrealistic</option><option value=\"childhood\">childhood</option><option value=\"educational\">educational</option></select> but the company has gained access to all public shows, comic books, dolls, apparels, and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"sequential\">sequential</option><option value=\"utopian\">utopian</option><option value=\"population\">population</option><option value=\"comedy\">comedy</option><option value=\"society\">society</option><option value=\"unrealistic\">unrealistic</option><option value=\"childhood\">childhood</option><option value=\"educational\">educational</option></select> film strips, which all point to the parks and each other.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、utopian</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ aspects appeal powerfully to real needs”，utopian aspects 意为“乌托邦式的方面”。表示迪士尼世界的乌托邦特质有力地吸引着资本主义社会的真实需求。utopian 与后文的 capitalist society 形成对照。因此填 utopian。</p>\n<p>2、society</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“in the capitalist ______”，capitalist society 是常见搭配，意为“资本主义社会”。表示乌托邦特质吸引的是资本主义社会中的需求。因此填 society。</p>\n<p>3、childhood</p>\n<p>考点:上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“captured the symbolic essence of ______”，迪士尼的主题与“童年”紧密相关。childhood 意为“童年”，符合语义。因此填 childhood。</p>\n<p>4、educational</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“public shows, comic books, dolls, apparels, and ______ film strips”，空格与前面的名词构成并列结构，共同列举迪士尼涉足的各类产品。educational film strips 意为“教育电影胶片”，符合语境。因此填 educational。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Walt Disney World has become a pilgrimage site partly because of the luminosity of its crosscultural and marketing and partly because its utopian aspects appeal powerfully to real needs in the capitalist society.</p>\n<p>迪士尼世界之所以成为一个朝圣场所,部分原因在于其跨文化营销的辉煌成功,部分原因在于其乌托邦方面强烈地满足了资本主义社会的实际需求。</p>\n<p>Disney' s marketing is unique because it captured the symbolic essence of childhood but the company has gained access to all public shows, comic books, dolls, apparels, and educational film strips, which all point to the parks and each other.</p>\n<p>迪士尼的营销是独特的,因为它捕捉到了童年的象征本质,但是该公司已经获得了所有公共演出、漫画书、洋娃娃、服装和教育电影㬵片的许可,所有这些都将人们指向公园。</p>",
