      "id": "fib-r-5may-high-1159",
      "question_id": 1159,
      "title": "Pandemic",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The pandemic created an <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"additional\">additional</option><option value=\"system\">system</option><option value=\"cost\">cost</option><option value=\"urgent\">urgent</option><option value=\"contribution\">contribution</option><option value=\"concentration\">concentration</option><option value=\"sector\">sector</option><option value=\"manufacturer\">manufacturer</option><option value=\"throughout\">throughout</option></select> situation, prompting unprecedented <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"additional\">additional</option><option value=\"system\">system</option><option value=\"cost\">cost</option><option value=\"urgent\">urgent</option><option value=\"contribution\">contribution</option><option value=\"concentration\">concentration</option><option value=\"sector\">sector</option><option value=\"manufacturer\">manufacturer</option><option value=\"throughout\">throughout</option></select> to bolster the health <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"additional\">additional</option><option value=\"system\">system</option><option value=\"cost\">cost</option><option value=\"urgent\">urgent</option><option value=\"contribution\">contribution</option><option value=\"concentration\">concentration</option><option value=\"sector\">sector</option><option value=\"manufacturer\">manufacturer</option><option value=\"throughout\">throughout</option></select> , reform the pharmaceutical <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"additional\">additional</option><option value=\"system\">system</option><option value=\"cost\">cost</option><option value=\"urgent\">urgent</option><option value=\"contribution\">contribution</option><option value=\"concentration\">concentration</option><option value=\"sector\">sector</option><option value=\"manufacturer\">manufacturer</option><option value=\"throughout\">throughout</option></select> , and distribute relief <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"additional\">additional</option><option value=\"system\">system</option><option value=\"cost\">cost</option><option value=\"urgent\">urgent</option><option value=\"contribution\">contribution</option><option value=\"concentration\">concentration</option><option value=\"sector\">sector</option><option value=\"manufacturer\">manufacturer</option><option value=\"throughout\">throughout</option></select> the country.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、urgent</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“created an ______ situation”。本句内部语义完整：疫情造成了“紧急的”情况。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“紧急的”形容词。因此填 urgent。</p>\n<p>2、contribution</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“unprecedented ______”。本句内部语义完整：疫情促使前所未有的“投入/贡献”来加强卫生系统。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“贡献/投入”的名词。因此填 contribution。</p>\n<p>3、system</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“bolster the health ______”。本句内部语义完整：加强卫生“系统”。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“系统”的名词。因此填 system。</p>\n<p>4、sector</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“reform the pharmaceutical ______”。本句内部语义完整：改革制药“行业”。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“行业/部门”的名词。因此填 sector。</p>\n<p>5、throughout</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“distribute relief ______ the country”。throughout the country 是固定搭配，意为“遍布全国/在全国范围内”。表示在全国范围内分发救济物资。因此填 throughout。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>The pandemic created an urgent situation, prompting unprecedented contribution to bolster the health system, reform the pharmaceutical sector, and distribute relief throughout the country.</p>\n<p>这场疫情造成了紧急局面，促使各方作出前所未有的贡献，以加强卫生系统、改革制药行业，并在全国范围内分发救济物资。</p>",
