      "title": "Body and Water",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Your body is nearly two-thirds water. And so it is really important that you <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"enlist\">enlist</option><option value=\"headaches\">headaches</option><option value=\"tired\">tired</option><option value=\"varied\">varied</option><option value=\"hydrated\">hydrated</option><option value=\"consume\">consume</option><option value=\"humble\">humble</option><option value=\"hardness\">hardness</option></select> enough fluid to stay <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"enlist\">enlist</option><option value=\"headaches\">headaches</option><option value=\"tired\">tired</option><option value=\"varied\">varied</option><option value=\"hydrated\">hydrated</option><option value=\"consume\">consume</option><option value=\"humble\">humble</option><option value=\"hardness\">hardness</option></select> and healthy. If you don't get enough fluid you may feel <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"enlist\">enlist</option><option value=\"headaches\">headaches</option><option value=\"tired\">tired</option><option value=\"varied\">varied</option><option value=\"hydrated\">hydrated</option><option value=\"consume\">consume</option><option value=\"humble\">humble</option><option value=\"hardness\">hardness</option></select> , get <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"enlist\">enlist</option><option value=\"headaches\">headaches</option><option value=\"tired\">tired</option><option value=\"varied\">varied</option><option value=\"hydrated\">hydrated</option><option value=\"consume\">consume</option><option value=\"humble\">humble</option><option value=\"hardness\">hardness</option></select> , and not perform at your best.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、consume</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“you ______ enough fluid”。本句内部语义完整：你的身体近三分之二是水，因此“摄入”足够的液体非常重要。consume 意为“摄入/饮用”，符合语义。因此填 consume。</p>\n<p>2、hydrated</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“stay ______ and healthy”，stay hydrated 是固定搭配，意为“保持水分充足”。表示摄入足够液体以保持水分充足和健康。因此填 hydrated。</p>\n<p>3、tired</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“you may feel ______”。本句内部语义完整：如果摄入液体不足，你可能会感觉“疲倦”。tired 意为“疲倦的”，符合语义。因此填 tired。</p>\n<p>4、headaches</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“get ______”。本句内部语义完整：缺水可能会导致“头痛”。headaches 意为“头痛”，符合语义。因此填 headaches。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Your body is nearly two-thirds water.</p>\n<p>你的身体几乎有三分之二是水。</p>\n<p>And so it is really important that you consume enough fluid to stay hydrated and healthy.</p>\n<p>因此，摄入足够的液体以保持身体水分充足和健康非常重要。</p>\n<p>If you don't get enough fluid you may feel tired , get headaches , and not perform at your best.</p>\n<p>如果你没有摄入足够的液体，你可能会感到疲倦、头痛，并且无法发挥最佳状态。</p>",
