      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>There are a number of substances (toxic as well as non-toxic) which are being added to the environment by pollution- caused <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"possessions\">possessions</option><option value=\"changes\">changes</option><option value=\"events\">events</option><option value=\"aspects\">aspects</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"intentions\">intentions</option></select> . These are, in fact, the undesirable consequences of modern civilization. These substances, which are continuously going into air, water and soil, bring about undesirable <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"possessions\">possessions</option><option value=\"changes\">changes</option><option value=\"events\">events</option><option value=\"aspects\">aspects</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"intentions\">intentions</option></select> in physical, chemical and biological <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"possessions\">possessions</option><option value=\"changes\">changes</option><option value=\"events\">events</option><option value=\"aspects\">aspects</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"intentions\">intentions</option></select> of our environment and the life <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"possessions\">possessions</option><option value=\"changes\">changes</option><option value=\"events\">events</option><option value=\"aspects\">aspects</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"intentions\">intentions</option></select> of animals and plants.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、events</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“pollution-caused ______”。本句内部语义完整：有许多物质通过污染引发的“事件”被添加到环境中。events 意为“事件”，在此处指污染导致的各种情况或事故。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“事件/情况”的名词。因此填 events。</p>\n<p>2、changes</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“bring about undesirable ______”。本句内部语义完整：这些物质持续进入空气、水和土壤，给环境带来不良的“变化”。changes 意为“变化”，与 bring about 搭配自然，表示引起/导致变化。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“变化”的名词。因此填 changes。</p>\n<p>3、aspects</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“physical, chemical and biological ______ of our environment”。本句内部语义完整：这些物质给环境的物理、化学和生物“方面”带来不良变化。aspects 意为“方面”，用于指代环境的不同维度或侧面。仅凭本句即可判断需要表示“方面/维度”的名词。因此填 aspects。</p>\n<p>4、processes</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the life ______ of animals and plants”。life processes 是固定搭配，意为“生命过程”，是生物学中的标准术语，指生物体维持生命所进行的一系列活动（如新陈代谢、生长、繁殖等）。表示这些物质影响动植物的生命过程。因此填 processes。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>There are a number of substances (toxic as well as non-toxic) which are being added to the environment by pollution- caused events .</p>\n<p>有许多物质，包括有毒和无毒物质，正在通过污染引发的事件被添加到环境中。</p>\n<p>These are, in fact, the undesirable consequences of modern civilization.</p>\n<p>事实上，这些都是现代文明带来的不良后果。</p>\n<p>These substances, which are continuously going into air, water and soil, bring about undesirable changes in physical, chemical and biological aspects of our environment and the life processes of animals and plants.</p>\n<p>这些持续进入空气、水和土壤的物质，会给我们环境的物理、化学和生物方面，以及动植物的生命过程带来不良变化。</p>",
