      "title": "Trinity Sport and Fitness",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Whether you want to exercise and stay <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"benefit\">benefit</option><option value=\"fit\">fit</option><option value=\"health\">health</option><option value=\"sense\">sense</option><option value=\"fun\">fun</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"entitle\">entitle</option><option value=\"impart\">impart</option><option value=\"has\">has</option><option value=\"makes\">makes</option></select> , train professionally with like-minded people, or indulge your competitive streak, Trinity Sport and Fitness <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"benefit\">benefit</option><option value=\"fit\">fit</option><option value=\"health\">health</option><option value=\"sense\">sense</option><option value=\"fun\">fun</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"entitle\">entitle</option><option value=\"impart\">impart</option><option value=\"has\">has</option><option value=\"makes\">makes</option></select> it covered. We've got a dedicated support development team on campus to support every student taking part in sports. You might want to participate in sports competitions volunteer with a local sports class or simply play for <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"benefit\">benefit</option><option value=\"fit\">fit</option><option value=\"health\">health</option><option value=\"sense\">sense</option><option value=\"fun\">fun</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"entitle\">entitle</option><option value=\"impart\">impart</option><option value=\"has\">has</option><option value=\"makes\">makes</option></select> with our social sport program. Trinity fitness members of our public- facing sports facility will also <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"benefit\">benefit</option><option value=\"fit\">fit</option><option value=\"health\">health</option><option value=\"sense\">sense</option><option value=\"fun\">fun</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"entitle\">entitle</option><option value=\"impart\">impart</option><option value=\"has\">has</option><option value=\"makes\">makes</option></select> you to discounts when you are booking a sports facility and fitness class. You will also get an opportunity to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"benefit\">benefit</option><option value=\"fit\">fit</option><option value=\"health\">health</option><option value=\"sense\">sense</option><option value=\"fun\">fun</option><option value=\"part\">part</option><option value=\"entitle\">entitle</option><option value=\"impart\">impart</option><option value=\"has\">has</option><option value=\"makes\">makes</option></select> from tailored personal training, free activities events, and lots more.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、fit</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“exercise and stay ______”，stay fit 是固定搭配，意为“保持健康/保持体型”。因此填 fit。</p>\n<p>2、has</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ it covered”，此处为“have + 宾语 + 过去分词”的结构，表示“使某事被处理/涵盖”。has 是 have 的第三人称单数形式，与主语 Trinity Sport and Fitness 保持一致。因此填 has。</p>\n<p>3、fun</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“play for ______”。本句内部语义完整：你可以通过社交体育项目只是为了“娱乐/乐趣”而参与运动。fun 意为“乐趣/娱乐”，符合语义。因此填 fun。</p>\n<p>4、entitle</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“will also ______ you to discounts”，entitle sb. to sth. 是固定搭配，意为“使某人有资格获得某物”。因此填 entitle。</p>\n<p>5、benefit</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“get an opportunity to ______ from”，benefit from 是固定搭配，意为“从……中受益”。因此填 benefit。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Whether you want to exercise and stay fit , train professionally with like-minded people, or indulge your competitive streak, Trinity Sport and Fitness has it covered.</p>\n<p>无论你是想锻炼并保持健康，还是想与志同道合的人一起进行专业训练，或者想释放自己的竞争天性，Trinity Sport and Fitness 都能满足你的需求。</p>\n<p>We've got a dedicated support development team on campus to support every student taking part in sports.</p>\n<p>我们在校园里有专门的支持发展团队，为每一位参加体育活动的学生提供支持。</p>\n<p>You might want to participate in sports competitions volunteer with a local sports class or simply play for fun with our social sport program.</p>\n<p>你可能想参加体育比赛，想在当地体育课程中做志愿者，或者只是想通过我们的社交体育项目开心地运动。</p>\n<p>Trinity fitness members of our public- facing sports facility will also entitle you to discounts when you are booking a sports facility and fitness class.</p>\n<p>Trinity 健身会员身份还会让你在预订体育设施和健身课程时享受折扣。</p>\n<p>You will also get an opportunity to benefit from tailored personal training, free activities events, and lots more.</p>\n<p>你还将有机会从量身定制的个人训练、免费活动以及更多服务中受益。</p>",
