      "passage_html": "<p>Pewter is an attractive metal which has been used for the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"production\">production</option><option value=\"harden\">harden</option><option value=\"distribution\">distribution</option><option value=\"soften\">soften</option><option value=\"mixed\">mixed</option><option value=\"containing\">containing</option><option value=\"consisting\">consisting</option></select> of household and other items in Britain since Roman times. It is an alloy <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"production\">production</option><option value=\"harden\">harden</option><option value=\"distribution\">distribution</option><option value=\"soften\">soften</option><option value=\"mixed\">mixed</option><option value=\"containing\">containing</option><option value=\"consisting\">consisting</option></select> mostly of tin which has been <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"production\">production</option><option value=\"harden\">harden</option><option value=\"distribution\">distribution</option><option value=\"soften\">soften</option><option value=\"mixed\">mixed</option><option value=\"containing\">containing</option><option value=\"consisting\">consisting</option></select> with small amounts of other metals such as copper, lead or antimony to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"prompted\">prompted</option><option value=\"production\">production</option><option value=\"harden\">harden</option><option value=\"distribution\">distribution</option><option value=\"soften\">soften</option><option value=\"mixed\">mixed</option><option value=\"containing\">containing</option><option value=\"consisting\">consisting</option></select> it and make it more durable.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、production</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the ______ of household and other items”。本句内部语义完整：白镴自古以来被用于家居用品和其他物品的“生产”。production 意为“生产”，符合语义。因此填 production。</p>\n<p>2、consisting</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“an alloy ______ mostly of tin”，consist of 是固定搭配，意为“由……组成”。表示它是一种主要由锡组成的合金。因此填 consisting。</p>\n<p>3、mixed</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“which has been ______ with small amounts of other metals”，此处为现在完成时的被动语态（has been + 过去分词），表示锡与少量的其他金属被混合在一起。因此填 mixed。</p>\n<p>4、harden</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“to ______ it and make it more durable”。本句内部语义完整：加入少量其他金属是为了“硬化”白镴并使其更耐用。harden 意为“硬化”，符合语义。因此填 harden。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Pewter is an attractive metal which has been used for the production of household and other items in Britain since Roman times.</p>\n<p>白镴是一种有吸引力的金属，自罗马时代以来就在英国被用于制作家用品和其他物品。</p>\n<p>It is an alloy consisting mostly of tin which has been mixed with small amounts of other metals such as copper, lead or antimony to harden it and make it more durable.</p>\n<p>它是一种主要由锡组成的合金，并混入少量其他金属，如铜、铅或锑，以使其变硬并更加耐用。</p>",
