      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Green spaces <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"addition\">addition</option><option value=\"focus\">focus</option><option value=\"background\">background</option><option value=\"low\">low</option><option value=\"differ\">differ</option><option value=\"context\">context</option><option value=\"massive\">massive</option><option value=\"reduction\">reduction</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option></select> significantly to a <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"addition\">addition</option><option value=\"focus\">focus</option><option value=\"background\">background</option><option value=\"low\">low</option><option value=\"differ\">differ</option><option value=\"context\">context</option><option value=\"massive\">massive</option><option value=\"reduction\">reduction</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option></select> of soil and aerial temperatures during spells of hot weather, so contributing to human wellbeing. In the garden <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"addition\">addition</option><option value=\"focus\">focus</option><option value=\"background\">background</option><option value=\"low\">low</option><option value=\"differ\">differ</option><option value=\"context\">context</option><option value=\"massive\">massive</option><option value=\"reduction\">reduction</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option></select> , there is, however, little information as to what extent various types of plants <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"addition\">addition</option><option value=\"focus\">focus</option><option value=\"background\">background</option><option value=\"low\">low</option><option value=\"differ\">differ</option><option value=\"context\">context</option><option value=\"massive\">massive</option><option value=\"reduction\">reduction</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option></select> in their cooling potential and how certain planting combinations may maximize cooling under a scenario of <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"addition\">addition</option><option value=\"focus\">focus</option><option value=\"background\">background</option><option value=\"low\">low</option><option value=\"differ\">differ</option><option value=\"context\">context</option><option value=\"massive\">massive</option><option value=\"reduction\">reduction</option><option value=\"contribute\">contribute</option></select> rainfall and minimal water inputs.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、contribute</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“Green spaces ______ significantly to a reduction”，contribute to 是固定搭配，意为“有助于/促成”。表示绿地显著有助于降低土壤和空气温度。因此填 contribute。</p>\n<p>2、reduction</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“a ______ of soil and aerial temperatures”，a reduction of 是常见搭配，意为“……的降低/减少”。表示绿地有助于土壤和空气温度的降低。因此填 reduction。</p>\n<p>3、context</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“In the garden ______”，in the context of 是固定搭配，意为“在……背景下/就……而言”。此处省略了 of，但 in the garden context 表示“在花园这一背景下”。因此填 context。</p>\n<p>4、differ</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“various types of plants ______ in their cooling potential”，differ in 是固定搭配，意为“在……方面不同”。表示不同类型的植物在降温潜力方面有何不同。因此填 differ。</p>\n<p>5、low</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“under a scenario of ______ rainfall”。本句内部语义完整：在“低”降雨量和最小水输入的情况下。low 意为“低的”，与 minimal water inputs（最小水输入）在语义上形成呼应。因此填 low。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Green spaces contribute significantly to a reduction of soil and aerial temperatures during spells of hot weather, so contributing to human wellbeing.</p>\n<p>在炎热天气期间，绿地能显著降低土壤和空气温度，因此有助于人类福祉。</p>\n<p>In the garden context , there is, however, little information as to what extent various types of plants differ in their cooling potential and how certain planting combinations may maximize cooling under a scenario of low rainfall and minimal water inputs.</p>\n<p>然而，在花园环境中，关于不同类型植物在降温潜力上有多大差异，以及在低降雨和最少浇水的情况下，某些植物组合如何最大化降温效果，目前信息仍然很少。</p>",
