      "id": "fib-r-5may-medium-421",
      "question_id": 421,
      "title": "Insect Concealment",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The world of species is tricky, in which it is often <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"attractive\">attractive</option><option value=\"appetizing\">appetizing</option><option value=\"cautious\">cautious</option><option value=\"fatal\">fatal</option><option value=\"conceal\">conceal</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"works\">works</option><option value=\"depends\">depends</option><option value=\"until\">until</option><option value=\"since\">since</option></select> for insects to be exposed, and they have to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"attractive\">attractive</option><option value=\"appetizing\">appetizing</option><option value=\"cautious\">cautious</option><option value=\"fatal\">fatal</option><option value=\"conceal\">conceal</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"works\">works</option><option value=\"depends\">depends</option><option value=\"until\">until</option><option value=\"since\">since</option></select> themselves in order to survive. For predators, nothing is less <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"attractive\">attractive</option><option value=\"appetizing\">appetizing</option><option value=\"cautious\">cautious</option><option value=\"fatal\">fatal</option><option value=\"conceal\">conceal</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"works\">works</option><option value=\"depends\">depends</option><option value=\"until\">until</option><option value=\"since\">since</option></select> than what appears to be a dead prey. This camouflage mechanism only <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"attractive\">attractive</option><option value=\"appetizing\">appetizing</option><option value=\"cautious\">cautious</option><option value=\"fatal\">fatal</option><option value=\"conceal\">conceal</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"works\">works</option><option value=\"depends\">depends</option><option value=\"until\">until</option><option value=\"since\">since</option></select> effectively when the insect stays completely still, often remaining hidden <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"attractive\">attractive</option><option value=\"appetizing\">appetizing</option><option value=\"cautious\">cautious</option><option value=\"fatal\">fatal</option><option value=\"conceal\">conceal</option><option value=\"thrive\">thrive</option><option value=\"works\">works</option><option value=\"depends\">depends</option><option value=\"until\">until</option><option value=\"since\">since</option></select> the danger has passed.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、fatal</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“it is often ______ for insects to be exposed”，be fatal for 是固定搭配，意为“对……是致命的”。表示昆虫暴露在外往往是致命的。因此填 fatal。</p>\n<p>2、conceal</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“they have to ______ themselves in order to survive”。本句内部语义完整：昆虫为了生存必须“隐藏”自己。conceal 意为“隐藏”，符合语义。因此填 conceal。</p>\n<p>3、appetizing</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“nothing is less ______ than what appears to be a dead prey”。本句内部语义完整：对于捕食者来说，没有什么比看起来像死去的猎物更不“吸引食欲”的了。appetizing 意为“开胃的”，符合语义。因此填 appetizing。</p>\n<p>4、works</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“This camouflage mechanism only ______ effectively when the insect stays completely still”。本句内部语义完整：这种伪装机制只有在昆虫完全静止时才能有效“起作用”。works 意为“起作用/奏效”，符合语义。因此填 works。</p>\n<p>5、until</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“often remaining hidden ______ the danger has passed”，until 引导时间状语从句，表示“直到……为止”。表示昆虫通常保持隐藏状态，直到危险过去。因此填 until。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>The world of species is tricky, in which it is often fatal for insects to be exposed, and they have to conceal themselves in order to survive.</p>\n<p>物种世界充满危险，在这个世界里，昆虫暴露在外往往是致命的，因此它们必须隐藏自己才能生存。</p>\n<p>For predators, nothing is less appetizing than what appears to be a dead prey.</p>\n<p>对于捕食者来说，没有什么比看起来已经死亡的猎物更不诱人。</p>\n<p>This camouflage mechanism only works effectively when the insect stays completely still, often remaining hidden until the danger has passed.</p>\n<p>这种伪装机制只有在昆虫完全保持静止时才有效，它们常常会一直隐藏到危险过去。</p>",
