      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>An American retail giant is set to ask its suppliers to measure and report their greenhouse gas emissions. There is a need to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"conflate\">conflate</option><option value=\"invigilators\">invigilators</option><option value=\"dislike\">dislike</option><option value=\"disclose\">disclose</option><option value=\"dismiss\">dismiss</option><option value=\"landlord\">landlord</option><option value=\"data\">data</option><option value=\"quota\">quota</option></select> business emission. The <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"conflate\">conflate</option><option value=\"invigilators\">invigilators</option><option value=\"dislike\">dislike</option><option value=\"disclose\">disclose</option><option value=\"dismiss\">dismiss</option><option value=\"landlord\">landlord</option><option value=\"data\">data</option><option value=\"quota\">quota</option></select> of emission can be used to test which company causes climate change, and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"conflate\">conflate</option><option value=\"invigilators\">invigilators</option><option value=\"dislike\">dislike</option><option value=\"disclose\">disclose</option><option value=\"dismiss\">dismiss</option><option value=\"landlord\">landlord</option><option value=\"data\">data</option><option value=\"quota\">quota</option></select> the government campaigners and environmental <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"conflate\">conflate</option><option value=\"invigilators\">invigilators</option><option value=\"dislike\">dislike</option><option value=\"disclose\">disclose</option><option value=\"dismiss\">dismiss</option><option value=\"landlord\">landlord</option><option value=\"data\">data</option><option value=\"quota\">quota</option></select> .</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、disclose</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“a need to ______ business emission”，disclose emission 是常见搭配，意为“披露/公开排放信息”。表示企业需要披露其业务排放数据。因此填 disclose。</p>\n<p>2、data</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“The ______ of emission can be used to test...”。本句内部语义完整：排放“数据”可用于测试哪些公司导致了气候变化。data 意为“数据”，与前后文的信息披露和测试逻辑相符。因此填 data。</p>\n<p>3、conflate</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“and ______ the government campaigners and environmental invigilators”，conflate A and B 是固定搭配，意为“将A和B混为一谈”。表示排放数据可用于将政府活动人士和环境监察员混为一谈。因此填 conflate。</p>\n<p>4、invigilators</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“environmental ______”。本句内部语义完整：排放数据可用于混淆政府活动人士和环境“监察员”。invigilators 意为“监察员/监督者”，environmental invigilators 指环境监督人员。因此填 invigilators。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>An American retail giant is set to ask its suppliers to measure and report their greenhouse gas emissions.</p>\n<p>一家美国零售巨头将要求其供应商测量并报告他们的温室气体排放量。</p>\n<p>There is a need to disclose business emission.</p>\n<p>商业排放需要被披露。</p>\n<p>The data of emission can be used to test which company causes climate change, and conflate the government campaigners and environmental invigilators .</p>\n<p>排放数据可以用来检验哪家公司造成了气候变化，并把政府活动人士和环境监督者联系起来。</p>",
