      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>In the preceding hundred years, Paris had been <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"movements\">movements</option><option value=\"rehearsals\">rehearsals</option><option value=\"concocted\">concocted</option><option value=\"shaken\">shaken</option><option value=\"overhead\">overhead</option><option value=\"center\">center</option></select> stage for political and social <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"movements\">movements</option><option value=\"rehearsals\">rehearsals</option><option value=\"concocted\">concocted</option><option value=\"shaken\">shaken</option><option value=\"overhead\">overhead</option><option value=\"center\">center</option></select> that had deeply affected all of Europe. The many ways in which tradition had already been challenged and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"movements\">movements</option><option value=\"rehearsals\">rehearsals</option><option value=\"concocted\">concocted</option><option value=\"shaken\">shaken</option><option value=\"overhead\">overhead</option><option value=\"center\">center</option></select> during those years helped make it easier for those to achieve a break with tradition art.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、center</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“Paris had been ______ stage”，center stage 是固定搭配，意为“中心舞台/核心位置”。表示巴黎一直是政治和社会运动的中心舞台。因此填 center。</p>\n<p>2、movements</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“political and social ______”。本句内部语义完整：巴黎一直是深刻影响整个欧洲的政治和社会“运动”的中心。movements 意为“运动”，符合语义。因此填 movements。</p>\n<p>3、shaken</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“tradition had already been challenged and ______”，challenged 和 shaken 由 and 连接，构成并列结构，共同描述传统所受到的冲击。shaken 意为“动摇”，与 challenged（挑战）语义相近。因此填 shaken。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>In the preceding hundred years, Paris had been center stage for political and social movements that had deeply affected all of Europe.</p>\n<p>在此前的一百年里，巴黎一直是政治和社会运动的中心舞台，而这些运动深刻影响了整个欧洲。</p>\n<p>The many ways in which tradition had already been challenged and shaken during those years helped make it easier for those to achieve a break with tradition art.</p>\n<p>在那些年里，传统已经以许多方式受到挑战和动摇，这使得人们更容易实现与传统艺术的决裂。</p>",
