      "title": "Paper Label",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Make sure your shipping envelopes are clean and dry, and remember to remove any paper shipping <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"brushes\">brushes</option><option value=\"locations\">locations</option><option value=\"process\">process</option><option value=\"prices\">prices</option><option value=\"panels\">panels</option><option value=\"scissors\">scissors</option><option value=\"labels\">labels</option></select> prior to dropping off <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"brushes\">brushes</option><option value=\"locations\">locations</option><option value=\"process\">process</option><option value=\"prices\">prices</option><option value=\"panels\">panels</option><option value=\"scissors\">scissors</option><option value=\"labels\">labels</option></select>. Paper labels are detrimental to the Store Drop- off recycling <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"brushes\">brushes</option><option value=\"locations\">locations</option><option value=\"process\">process</option><option value=\"prices\">prices</option><option value=\"panels\">panels</option><option value=\"scissors\">scissors</option><option value=\"labels\">labels</option></select> . If the labels don’t peel off easily, you can cut them off with <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"brushes\">brushes</option><option value=\"locations\">locations</option><option value=\"process\">process</option><option value=\"prices\">prices</option><option value=\"panels\">panels</option><option value=\"scissors\">scissors</option><option value=\"labels\">labels</option></select> .</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>labels</p>\n<p>考点：上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析：空格位于“paper shipping ______”。前文提到“shipping envelopes are clean and dry”，后文又说“Paper labels are detrimental...”，说明这里指的是贴在信封上的纸质“标签”。因此填 labels。</p>\n<p>locations</p>\n<p>考点：固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析：空格位于“dropping off ______”。drop-off locations 是常见搭配，意为“投放点/回收点”。句子指在把信封送到回收点之前撕掉标签。因此填 locations。</p>\n<p>process</p>\n<p>考点：单句理解</p>\n<p>解析：空格位于“Store Drop-off recycling ______”。整句意思是纸质标签对商店回收“过程”有害。process 意为“过程/流程”，符合语义。因此填 process。</p>\n<p>scissors</p>\n<p>考点：上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析：空格位于“cut them off with ______”。前句说如果标签不容易撕掉，就用工具剪掉。选项中 scissors（剪刀）是合理工具。因此填 scissors。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Make sure your shipping envelopes are clean and dry, and remember to remove any paper shipping labels prior to dropping off locations.</p>\n<p>确保你的运输信封干净且干燥，并记住在送到回收点之前，去掉所有纸质运输标签。</p>\n<p>Paper labels are detrimental to the Store Drop-off recycling process.</p>\n<p>纸质标签对商店回收流程是有害的。</p>\n<p>If the labels don’t peel off easily, you can cut them off with scissors.</p>\n<p>如果标签不容易撕掉，你可以用剪刀把它们剪掉。</p>",
