      "id": "fib-r-5may-medium-364",
      "question_id": 364,
      "title": "Inflation",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The influence of inflation can be seen in almost every sector. Inflation increases the price of goods and services, and business often lost <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"visit\">visit</option><option value=\"compete\">compete</option><option value=\"research\">research</option><option value=\"control\">control</option><option value=\"means\">means</option><option value=\"accounts\">accounts</option></select> of their building contracts. International competition <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"visit\">visit</option><option value=\"compete\">compete</option><option value=\"research\">research</option><option value=\"control\">control</option><option value=\"means\">means</option><option value=\"accounts\">accounts</option></select> that companies are forced to <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"visit\">visit</option><option value=\"compete\">compete</option><option value=\"research\">research</option><option value=\"control\">control</option><option value=\"means\">means</option><option value=\"accounts\">accounts</option></select> under difficult conditions.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、control</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“lost ______ of their building contracts”，lost control of 是固定搭配，意为“失去对……的控制”。表示通货膨胀导致企业常常失去对建筑合同的控制。因此填 control。</p>\n<p>2、means</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“International competition ______ that companies are forced to...”。本句内部语义完整：国际竞争“意味着”公司被迫在困难的条件下竞争。means 意为“意味着”，符合语义。因此填 means。</p>\n<p>3、compete</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“forced to ______ under difficult conditions”。本句内部语义完整：公司被迫在困难条件下“竞争”。compete 意为“竞争”，符合语义。因此填 compete。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>The influence of inflation can be seen in almost every sector.</p>\n<p>通货膨胀的影响几乎可以在每一个行业中看到。</p>\n<p>Inflation increases the price of goods and services, and business often lost control of their building contracts.</p>\n<p>通货膨胀会提高商品和服务的价格，企业也常常会失去对建筑合同的控制。</p>\n<p>International competition means that companies are forced to compete under difficult conditions.</p>\n<p>国际竞争意味着公司被迫在困难条件下竞争。</p>",
