      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>My son is <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"unable\">unable</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"sick\">sick</option><option value=\"well\">well</option><option value=\"painful\">painful</option><option value=\"sorry\">sorry</option><option value=\"previous\">previous</option><option value=\"happy\">happy</option></select> to attend school. On the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"unable\">unable</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"sick\">sick</option><option value=\"well\">well</option><option value=\"painful\">painful</option><option value=\"sorry\">sorry</option><option value=\"previous\">previous</option><option value=\"happy\">happy</option></select> night I found he was <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"unable\">unable</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"sick\">sick</option><option value=\"well\">well</option><option value=\"painful\">painful</option><option value=\"sorry\">sorry</option><option value=\"previous\">previous</option><option value=\"happy\">happy</option></select> and now I think it is better for him not to go to school so that we can avoid infection. I believe after some rest he will become <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"unable\">unable</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"sick\">sick</option><option value=\"well\">well</option><option value=\"painful\">painful</option><option value=\"sorry\">sorry</option><option value=\"previous\">previous</option><option value=\"happy\">happy</option></select> and will successfully pass his exam. And I am <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"unable\">unable</option><option value=\"difficult\">difficult</option><option value=\"sick\">sick</option><option value=\"well\">well</option><option value=\"painful\">painful</option><option value=\"sorry\">sorry</option><option value=\"previous\">previous</option><option value=\"happy\">happy</option></select> to help him catch up on the missed lessons.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、unable</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“My son is ______ to attend school”，be unable to do sth. 是固定搭配，意为“无法做某事”。表示儿子无法上学。因此填 unable。</p>\n<p>2、previous</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“On the ______ night”。本句内部语义完整：在前一天晚上，我发现他生病了。previous 意为“之前的/前一天的”，符合语义。因此填 previous。</p>\n<p>3、sick</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“I found he was ______”。本句内部语义完整：我发现他生病了。sick 意为“生病的”，符合语义。因此填 sick。</p>\n<p>4、well</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“he will become ______”，become well 是常见搭配，意为“变好/康复”。表示休息后他会康复并成功通过考试。因此填 well。</p>\n<p>5、happy</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“I am ______ to help him”，be happy to do sth. 是常见搭配，意为“乐意做某事”。表示我乐意帮助他补上错过的课程。因此填 happy。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>My son is unable to attend school.</p>\n<p>我的儿子无法去上学。</p>\n<p>On the previous night I found he was sick and now I think it is better for him not to go to school so that we can avoid infection.</p>\n<p>前一天晚上我发现他生病了，现在我认为他最好不要去学校，这样我们可以避免传染。</p>\n<p>I believe after some rest he will become well and will successfully pass his exam.</p>\n<p>我相信休息一段时间后他会恢复健康，并且能够顺利通过考试。</p>\n<p>And I am happy to help him catch up on the missed lessons.</p>\n<p>我也很愿意帮助他补上错过的课程。</p>",
