      "title": "Oakham",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>The Oakham Area Career Program offers on-site, in-house teaching: the course <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"is taught\">is taught</option><option value=\"was teaching\">was teaching</option><option value=\"imparting\">imparting</option><option value=\"meaning\">meaning</option><option value=\"for\">for</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"such as\">such as</option><option value=\"rather than\">rather than</option></select> by experienced instructors, <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"is taught\">is taught</option><option value=\"was teaching\">was teaching</option><option value=\"imparting\">imparting</option><option value=\"meaning\">meaning</option><option value=\"for\">for</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"such as\">such as</option><option value=\"rather than\">rather than</option></select> outsourcing it. Our teachers understand each student's individual learning needs, <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"is taught\">is taught</option><option value=\"was teaching\">was teaching</option><option value=\"imparting\">imparting</option><option value=\"meaning\">meaning</option><option value=\"for\">for</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"such as\">such as</option><option value=\"rather than\">rather than</option></select> learners receive personalized feedback and support. This way, you'll never miss a class <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"is taught\">is taught</option><option value=\"was teaching\">was teaching</option><option value=\"imparting\">imparting</option><option value=\"meaning\">meaning</option><option value=\"for\">for</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"such as\">such as</option><option value=\"rather than\">rather than</option></select> any reason.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、is taught</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the course ______ by experienced instructors”，主语 the course 与 teach（教授）之间为被动关系，is taught 为一般现在时的被动语态。表示课程由经验丰富的教师授课。因此填 is taught。</p>\n<p>2、rather than</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ outsourcing it”，rather than 是固定搭配，意为“而不是”。表示课程由经验丰富的教师在校授课，而不是外包出去。因此填 rather than。</p>\n<p>3、meaning</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ learners receive personalized feedback”，此处为现在分词作结果状语，表示前面“教师理解每个学生的个人学习需求”这一情况带来的结果是学习者获得个性化反馈和支持。因此填 meaning。</p>\n<p>4、for</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“never miss a class ______ any reason”，for any reason 是固定搭配，意为“因为任何原因”。表示你不会因为任何原因缺课。因此填 for。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>The Oakham Area Career Program offers on-site, in-house teaching: the course is taught by experienced instructors, rather than outsourcing it.</p>\n<p>奥克姆地区职业项目提供现场内部教学：课程由经验丰富的教师授课，而不是外包出去。</p>\n<p>Our teachers understand each student's individual learning needs, meaning learners receive personalized feedback and support.</p>\n<p>我们的老师了解每位学生的个体学习需求，这意味着学习者会获得个性化的反馈和支持。</p>\n<p>This way, you'll never miss a class for any reason.</p>\n<p>这样一来，你就不会因为任何原因错过课程。</p>",
