      "title": "Citizenship Education",
      "type": "FIB_R",
      "frequency": "中频",
      "passage_html": "<p>Civics and citizenship education builds student's knowledge and understanding of the ways in which citizens can actively <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"precision\">precision</option><option value=\"skills\">skills</option><option value=\"involve\">involve</option><option value=\"humanity\">humanity</option><option value=\"participate\">participate</option><option value=\"wills\">wills</option><option value=\"community\">community</option></select> in Australia' s diverse and inclusive society. Students learn about the civic institutions and the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"precision\">precision</option><option value=\"skills\">skills</option><option value=\"involve\">involve</option><option value=\"humanity\">humanity</option><option value=\"participate\">participate</option><option value=\"wills\">wills</option><option value=\"community\">community</option></select> through which decisions are made for the common good of the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"precision\">precision</option><option value=\"skills\">skills</option><option value=\"involve\">involve</option><option value=\"humanity\">humanity</option><option value=\"participate\">participate</option><option value=\"wills\">wills</option><option value=\"community\">community</option></select> and they also develop the <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"processes\">processes</option><option value=\"precision\">precision</option><option value=\"skills\">skills</option><option value=\"involve\">involve</option><option value=\"humanity\">humanity</option><option value=\"participate\">participate</option><option value=\"wills\">wills</option><option value=\"community\">community</option></select> and understandings that relate to the organization of a harmonious democratic society.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、participate</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“actively ______ in Australia&#x27;s diverse and inclusive society”，participate in 是固定搭配，意为“参与”。表示学生了解公民积极参与社会的方式。因此填 participate。</p>\n<p>2、processes</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“the civic institutions and the ______”。本句内部语义完整：学生了解公民机构以及决策的“过程”。processes 意为“过程/流程”，符合语义。因此填 processes。</p>\n<p>3、community</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“for the common good of the ______”。本句内部语义完整：决策是为了“社区”的共同利益。community 意为“社区”，符合语义。因此填 community。</p>\n<p>4、skills</p>\n<p>考点:并列结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“develop the ______ and understandings”，skills and understandings 由 and 连接，构成并列结构，表示学生培养相关的技能和理解。因此填 skills。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>Civics and citizenship education builds student's knowledge and understanding of the ways in which citizens can actively participate in Australia' s diverse and inclusive society.</p>\n<p>公民与公民身份教育培养学生的知识和理解，使他们了解公民可以通过哪些方式积极参与澳大利亚多元而包容的社会。</p>\n<p>Students learn about the civic institutions and the processes through which decisions are made for the common good of the community and they also develop the skills and understandings that relate to the organization of a harmonious democratic society.</p>\n<p>学生学习公民机构以及为社区共同利益作出决策的过程，同时也培养与组织和谐民主社会相关的技能和理解。</p>",
