      "passage_html": "<p>For birdwatchers in southern New Mexico, September can be highly entertaining. Good numbers of many diverse <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"genes\">genes</option><option value=\"up\">up</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option><option value=\"migrating\">migrating</option><option value=\"warmer\">warmer</option><option value=\"species\">species</option><option value=\"quantity\">quantity</option><option value=\"off\">off</option><option value=\"traveling\">traveling</option><option value=\"breeding\">breeding</option></select> are on the move during this time, <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"genes\">genes</option><option value=\"up\">up</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option><option value=\"migrating\">migrating</option><option value=\"warmer\">warmer</option><option value=\"species\">species</option><option value=\"quantity\">quantity</option><option value=\"off\">off</option><option value=\"traveling\">traveling</option><option value=\"breeding\">breeding</option></select> southward from northern <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"genes\">genes</option><option value=\"up\">up</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option><option value=\"migrating\">migrating</option><option value=\"warmer\">warmer</option><option value=\"species\">species</option><option value=\"quantity\">quantity</option><option value=\"off\">off</option><option value=\"traveling\">traveling</option><option value=\"breeding\">breeding</option></select> grounds to places they will spend the winter, and there's always a <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"genes\">genes</option><option value=\"up\">up</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option><option value=\"migrating\">migrating</option><option value=\"warmer\">warmer</option><option value=\"species\">species</option><option value=\"quantity\">quantity</option><option value=\"off\">off</option><option value=\"traveling\">traveling</option><option value=\"breeding\">breeding</option></select> that some rare or unusual birds will turn <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"5\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"genes\">genes</option><option value=\"up\">up</option><option value=\"chance\">chance</option><option value=\"migrating\">migrating</option><option value=\"warmer\">warmer</option><option value=\"species\">species</option><option value=\"quantity\">quantity</option><option value=\"off\">off</option><option value=\"traveling\">traveling</option><option value=\"breeding\">breeding</option></select>.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、species</p>\n<p>考点:单句理解</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“many diverse ______”。本句内部语义完整：九月份有许多不同“种类”的鸟类在迁徙。species 意为“物种/种类”，符合语义。因此填 species。</p>\n<p>2、traveling</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“______ southward from northern breeding grounds”，此处为现在分词作伴随状语，修饰前面的 are on the move。traveling 表示鸟类正在从北方繁殖地向南迁徙。因此填 traveling。</p>\n<p>3、breeding</p>\n<p>考点:固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“northern ______ grounds”，breeding grounds 是固定搭配，意为“繁殖地/繁殖场所”。表示鸟类从北方的繁殖地向南迁徙。因此填 breeding。</p>\n<p>4、chance</p>\n<p>考点:语法结构</p>\n<p>解析: 空格位于“there’s always a ______ that...”，此处为“there be + 名词 + that 从句”结构，其中从句是修饰名词的。chance 意为“可能性”，符合语法结构；且there is a chance that...是固定句型，意为“有可能……”</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>For birdwatchers in southern New Mexico, September can be highly entertaining.</p>\n<p>对于新墨西哥州南部的观鸟者来说，九月可能非常有趣。</p>\n<p>Good numbers of many diverse species are on the move during this time, traveling southward from northern breeding grounds to places they will spend the winter, and there's always a chance that some rare or unusual birds will turn up.</p>\n<p>在这段时间里，许多不同物种的大量鸟类都在迁徙，从北方的繁殖地向南飞往它们过冬的地方，而且总有可能出现一些稀有或不同寻常的鸟类。</p>",
