      "passage_html": "<p>With the increase in women's <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"attendance\">attendance</option><option value=\"substitution\">substitution</option><option value=\"participation\">participation</option><option value=\"definition\">definition</option></select> in the labour force, many mothers have less time <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"available\">available</option><option value=\"related\">related</option><option value=\"consumable\">consumable</option><option value=\"useful\">useful</option></select> to undertake domestic activities. At the same time, there has been increasing <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"recognition\">recognition</option><option value=\"discrimination\">discrimination</option><option value=\"resolution\">resolution</option><option value=\"recreation\">recreation</option></select> that the father's role and <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"scholarship\">scholarship</option><option value=\"relationship\">relationship</option><option value=\"worship\">worship</option><option value=\"employment\">employment</option></select> with a child is important. A father can have many roles in the family, ranging from income provider to teacher, carer, playmate and role model. Therefore, balancing paid work and family responsibilities can be an important issue for both fathers and mothers in families.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、 participation</p>\n<p>考点：上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析：句子这里需要表达“参与”这一含义。后文提到了女性在劳动力队伍(labour force)中的增加,以及母亲做家务时间变少的情况,这属于女性在就业方面的参与度提高,该词能够准确补充句意,并与上下文语境保持一致。</p>\n<p>2、 available</p>\n<p>考点：上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析：句子这里需要表达“可支配的、可用的”这一含义。由于女性越来越多地投入工作,母亲们用来从事家庭活动(domestic activities)的时间必然会变少,available 作为后置定语修饰 time,能够准确补充句意。</p>\n<p>3、 recognition</p>\n<p>考点：上下文语境</p>\n<p>解析：句子这里需要表达“认可、意识到”这一含义。后文详细阐述了父亲作为经济提供者、教师、照顾者等多种重要角色,说明全社会逐渐“意识到”或“认可”父亲角色的重要性,该词能够准确与上下文语境保持一致。</p>\n<p>4、 relationship</p>\n<p>考点：固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析：这个答案考查的是固定搭配。relationship with a child 构成固定搭配,意思是“与孩子的关系”。文中强调父亲的角色以及他与孩子之间的亲子关系对孩子的成长非常重要。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>With the increase in women's participation in the labour force, many mothers have less time available to undertake domestic activities.</p>\n<p>随着女性在劳动力队伍中参与度的提高,许多母亲可以用来从事家庭活动的时间变少了。</p>\n<p>At the same time, there has been increasing recognition that the father's role and relationship with a child is important.</p>\n<p>与此同时,人们也日益认识到父亲的角色以及他与孩子之间的关系是至关重要的。</p>\n<p>A father can have many roles in the family, ranging from income provider to teacher, carer, playmate and role model.</p>\n<p>父亲在家庭中可以扮演多种角色,从经济提供者到教师、照顾者、玩伴以及榜样。</p>\n<p>Therefore, balancing paid work and family responsibilities can be an important issue for both fathers and mothers in families.</p>\n<p>因此,平衡有薪工作与家庭责任对家庭中的父亲和母亲来说,都是一个重要的议题。</p>",
