      "question_id": 1263,
      "title": "Driver License",
      "type": "FIB_RW",
      "frequency": "极高频",
      "passage_html": "<p>New B.C. residents will only be required to provide their driver licence history ― proof of insurance is no longer required. However, their premiums will be adjusted for the first three years <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"1\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"within\">within</option><option value=\"among\">among</option><option value=\"for\">for</option><option value=\"of\">of</option></select> driving in B.C. <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"2\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"because\">because</option><option value=\"as for\">as for</option><option value=\"due to\">due to</option><option value=\"thanks to\">thanks to</option></select> the increased risks associated with driving in a new area. Each year you remain crash-free, your discount increases. ICBC <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"3\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"crediting\">crediting</option><option value=\"credited\">credited</option><option value=\"credit\">credit</option><option value=\"will credit\">will credit</option></select> you with up to 15 years of driving experience (up from eight years) upon receipt of a driver's abstract <select class=\"blank-select\" data-blank-index=\"4\"><option value=\"\">选择答案</option><option value=\"shown\">shown</option><option value=\"shows\">shows</option><option value=\"show\">show</option><option value=\"showing\">showing</option></select> the original date that you received your licence. When obtaining your B.C. licence, you can provide your original driver's abstract in person at a driver licensing office.</p>",
      "analysis_html": "<p>1、 of</p>\n<p>考点：固定搭配</p>\n<p>解析：这个答案考查的是介词搭配。the first three years of driving in B.C. 意为“在不列颠哥伦比亚省(B.C.)驾驶的前三年”,介词 of 在此用于表示所属或范围,说明这三年的具体内容是关于在当地驾驶的经历。</p>\n<p>2、 due to</p>\n<p>考点：逻辑衔接</p>\n<p>解析：句子这里需要表达“由于、因为”这一含义。后文提到了“在新地区驾驶所带来的风险增加”,这是导致保费在头三年进行调整的原因,due to 引导原因短语,能够准确地在句中建立起这种因果逻辑关系。</p>\n<p>3、 will credit</p>\n<p>考点：时态语态</p>\n<p>解析：这个答案考查的是一般将来时。根据上下文,整个政策文件是在说明新居民未来办理该业务时的规则和流程。由条件状语 upon receipt of...(一经收到......)可知,ICBC 给予驾驶经验减免的动作发生在收到证明之后,因此使用一般将来时 will credit 最符合语境。</p>\n<p>4、 showing</p>\n<p>考点：非谓语形式</p>\n<p>解析：这个答案考查的是非谓语形式。此处使用现在分词短语 showing... 作后置定语,修饰前面的名词 a driver's abstract(驾驶员档案摘要),它们之间是主动关系,即“一份显示了你最初获得驾照日期的档案摘要”,该词能够准确补充句意。</p>",
      "translation_html": "<p>New BC residents will only be required to provide their driver licence history; proof of insurance is no longer required.</p>\n<p>新的不列颠哥伦比亚省居民只需提供驾驶执照历史;不再需要保险证明。</p>\n<p>However, their premiums will be adjusted for the first three years of driving in BC due to the increased risks associated with driving in a new area.</p>\n<p>不过,由于在新地区驾驶风险更高,他们在不列颠哥伦比亚省驾驶的前三年保费会被调整。</p>\n<p>Each year you remain crash-free, your discount increases.</p>\n<p>每保持一年无事故,你的折扣就会增加。</p>\n<p>ICBC will credit you with up to 15 years of driving experience upon receipt of a driver's abstract showing the original date that you received your licence.</p>\n<p>ICBC 收到显示你最初取得驾照日期的驾驶记录摘要后,最多会认可你 15 年的驾驶经验。</p>\n<p>When obtaining your BC licence, you can provide your original driver's abstract in person at a driver licensing office.</p>\n<p>办理不列颠哥伦比亚省驾照时,你可以亲自到驾驶执照办公室提交原始驾驶记录摘要。</p>",
